en:
You did it! You found out what the Twilight's Hammer were up to and you stopped them dead in their tracks!

&lt;Mowi gets up on her tippy toes and gives you a kiss on the cheek.&gt;

Now I'm certain that I have something around here for you.

&lt;She begins rummaging around for your reward.&gt;

ua:
Ти це $p(зробив:зробила)! Ти $p(дізнався:дізналася), що затіяв Молот Сутінків, і $p(зупинив:зупинила) їх на місці!

&lt;Мові піднімається навшпиньки й цілує тебе в щоку.&gt;

Тепер я впевнена, що в мене тут щось для тебе знайдеться.

&lt;Вона починає порпатися в пошуках твоєї нагороди.&gt;

en:
&lt;Rexxar nods.&gt;

You're here. Our strongest warriors are eager to attack the estate.

Let's not keep them waiting.

Ordinn sent you with these?

&lt;The smith examines the ingots.&gt;

He was right. Most of the magic is gone, but I can still sense traces of it. With some work and a few 'exotic' resources, I can forge you a powerful anti-demon sword from this metal.

Collect 5 Windrunner Memorabilia.
5Partially-Used Memento (5)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(249542, 0, 5, null, null));

ua:
Збери 5 пам'яток Віндраннерів.
5Частково використаний спомин (5)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(249542, 0, 5, null, null));

en:
And now we shall see what the future holds for you.

&lt;The Bone Witch casts the bones upon the rug in front of her.&gt;

Choose your fate, &lt;class&gt;.

&lt;Beads of sweat roll down Boog's overly large forehead as he reads the translated letter.&gt;

This is bad. Really, really bad. You have to warn Lord Fallowmere at Windshear Hold.

What in the... It's MOVING! The goblin balloon is taking off! We're too late!

&lt;Kilrok pages through the plans you discovered.&gt;

This explains much, &lt;name&gt;. No wonder our foes are so hellbent on taking the southern Barrens. It's at the center of their plans for the continent!

But they didn't account for us, did they &lt;class&gt;?

Collect 12 Spiteful Shadowgraft from wild creatures in the Bastion of Might.
12Spiteful Shadowgraft (12)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(247422, 0, 12, null, null));

ua:
Збери 12 Злісних тіньових щеплень зі диких істот у Бастіоні Могутності.
12Злісне тіньове щеплення (12)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(247422, 0, 12, null, null));

en:
&lt;That looks like the last of Art's rods.

You manage to salvage some of Art's bait with your catch. 

Waste not, want not&gt;

&lt;Saurfang grins.&gt;

It looks familiar... The Might of Kalimdor trampled a thousand bugs like this one in the desert of Silithus.

This is a different place - a different environment - but the result will be the same.

&lt;Saurfang looks you over.&gt;

You will bring pride and honor to the Horde in Northrend, &lt;name&gt;.

Ah, well done, friend. These are finer than I thought they'd be. They'll make a fine cloak.

&lt;Bertelm glances toward the inn.&gt;

Yes, a fine cloak it shall be.

Collect Golden Sunleaf at Stillwhisper Pond.
6Golden Sunleaf (6)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(245531, 0, 6, null, null));

