en:
&lt;Brann takes the fragments and begins reassembling them.&gt;

Well, ye definitely found more o' the Titan Disc, but ye found something else too.

Here, take a look at that!

ua:
&lt;Бранн бере фрагменти й починає їх складати.&gt;

Ну, ти точно $p(знайшов:знайшла) ще частину Диска титанів, але $p(знайшов:знайшла) дещо інше також.

Ось, поглянь-но на це!

en:
Shiver me timbers and timber me shivers!  Ye found me beautiful eye!  Let's see if she still fits.

&lt;Kshhh-thunk&gt;

&lt;name&gt; ho!  Blimey, I can see!!

ua:
Хай мене корова вбрикне і тремтіння тремтить мене! Ти $p(знайшов:знайшла) моє прекрасне око! Погляньмо, чи воно ще підійде.

&lt;Тсс-грюк&gt;

Ей, {name}! Дідько, я бачу!!

en:
What in the world have you brought me?! Nat told you to ask me to turn THIS into a pole?

&lt;Marcia takes the severed lure from you. As she holds it close to the pearl, it begins to resonate with it.&gt;

That's interesting. There seems to be a connection between this and the pearl. Maybe turning this into a fishing rod can yield some interesting results...

ua:
Що за дивину ти мені $p(приніс:принесла)?! Нат сказав попросити мене зробити з ЦЬОГО вудку?

&lt;Марсія бере в тебе відрізану приманку. Коли вона підносить її до перлини, та починає з нею резонувати.&gt;

Цікаво. Схоже, тут є якийсь зв'язок із перлиною. Можливо, якщо перетворити це на вудку, вийде щось цікаве...

en:
Collect 6 Whole Uncursed Livers in the Serpent's Tail.
6Whole Uncursed Liver (6)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(278094, 0, 6, null, null));

ua:
Збери 6 цілих непроклятих печінок у Зміїному Хвості.
6Ціла непроклята печінка (6)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(278094, 0, 6, null, null));

en:
&lt;Halford says a prayer for the deceased.&gt;

You do the Light's work, &lt;name&gt;.

I fear that our work has only just begun.

&lt;You recount your findings about the shrine in Drustvar to Samuel.&gt;

How fortunate for us that the inhabitants of that area used the same rocks to create their constructs from.

I suppose luck is on our side in the quest for these shrines.

ua:
&lt;Ти розповідаєш Самуелю про своє відкриття святилища у Друстварі.&gt;

Яке щастя, що мешканці тих країв використовували ті самі камені для своїх виробів.

Схоже, удача на нашому боці в пошуках цих святилищ.

en:
&lt;Onatay looks over the fresh hides, nodding her head slowly.&gt;

Yes &lt;name&gt;, I can work with these. You work fast!

These hides will help us hold out for reinforcements longer. Thank you.

&lt;Stefan sifts through the foul components.&gt;

Well, it's far from perfect, but it'll have to do.

Now brace yourself, &lt;class&gt;. This is where it gets good....

&lt;The F.C.D. crackles with static.&gt;

Dreadwatch is lost? This is bad, &lt;name&gt;. Real bad.

If Dreadwatch is compromised it means we've lost Gilneas City.

Kota has asked for gorm gris?

&lt;Master Sha'lor beams with excitement.&gt;

I would be happy to oblige her request! Come, let me show you how this works.

Some very angry judges recently passed through here.

&lt;Archivist Fane grins.&gt;

Tell me everything you did to antagonize them. Don't skip a single detail!

&lt;Your trainer looks over the pistil and stamen, clearly impressed.&gt;

The Earthmother must have been feeling generous when she created the aethril.

Continue to focus on this part of the flower, &lt;name&gt;.

Is that?

&lt;Jane takes the locket and opens it tenderly. Tears begin to well up in her eyes as she closes it and tucks it away in her jacket.&gt;

Thank you.

&lt;Narkrall clenches the insignias in his weathered hand.&gt;

So, &lt;class&gt;. There's more to you than meets the eye.

Maybe your Horde can stand with the best of my warriors. Let's try you out...

Your work is appreciated, soldier.

&lt;The commander leans in close, and whispers:&gt;

&lt;race&gt;... if you're still interested, I have one more small task for you...

Is that what I think it is?

&lt;Ta'xera examines the stonefiend closely.&gt;

In perfect condition! I can't wait to study every intricacy.

Hunt down beasts around Har'athir and collect materials to forge a Ka'dani weapon.
Chloroceros Bone (1)
