WH.ge('icon-list-icon2').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(278534, 0, 1, null, null));

en:
Neato!  A dragon of my very own!  One day I hope that I'm lucky enough to have a dragon as a friend.

&lt;Dornaa bounces up and down with joy, fiercely hugging her new toy.&gt;

This has been the best trip ever!  I hope it never ends.

&lt;Tanithria listens to your account of Lyndras' fate.&gt;

I... I see. That's a shame.

I had grown to enjoy his company, you know. If you'll excuse me, I need a moment to think about him.

Collect 100 Sparks of War in the Coiled Isle, while in War Mode.
100Spark of War (100)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(219934, 0, 100, null, null));

&lt;Flintlocke wipes tears from his eyes.&gt;

Oh, &lt;name&gt;. &lt;name&gt;!

That ... were beautiful.

