en:
&lt;Theldren inspects the musken-hide belt thoroughly.&gt;

Oh, my. Is that fresh blood? I'll be sure to clean it up.

On second thought, it does add to the piece. Such authenticity! Don't you agree?

So Tony is running the show there now? Good! We need more pirates like him in these waters. He's a real businessman.

&lt;Dizzywig rubs his hands together greedily.&gt;

Speaking of business, I suppose I owe you a cut. Would you be interested in insuring any of your new loot? You never know what can happen in a town like this...

&lt;Aethas's posture is etched with the exhaustion of sleepless nights and days without food. His tattered clothes hang loosely on his emaciated frame, and his every movement seems fatigued.&gt;

I see. I knew Khadgar was gravely injured but... it did not occur to me that his wounds were more than physical.

I respect his choice not to come here.

This is far worse than what was noted in Luther's journal. They've got this place covered in Scourge and are infecting everything they touch.

&lt;Ickoris nods.&gt;

It gets worse - if you can imagine such a thing...

ua:
Це значно гірше, ніж записано в щоденнику Лютера. Вони вкрили це місце Плеттю й заражають усе, чого торкаються.

&lt;Ікорис киває.&gt;

Стає ще гірше — якщо таке взагалі можна уявити...

en:
YEAH!!! FLITTERLING DUST!!!

&lt;Olon throws the powder into the pot.&gt;

This brew is turning out... strange, and pretty smelly. I'm starting to think maybe Lya was right.

&lt;A'dal's thoughts intermingle with your own.&gt;

The sphere... Strange. Did you know that he lived? Yes. It is here - in the sphere itself. Maimed for certain. He calls to a higher power now. No, not Illidan.

Higher.

Kil'jaeden the Deceiver comes...

Not here...

&lt;A'dal points your mind elsewhere.&gt;

Azeroth. Unknown.

Rest. Your brothers and sisters will retake Tempest Keep now.

&lt;A'dal hums a song of battle.&gt;

ua:
&lt;Думки А'дала переплітаються з твоїми.&gt;

Сфера... Дивно. Чи було тобі відомо, що він живий? Так. Він тут — у самій сфері. Скалічений, певно. Він волає до вищої сили. Ні, не Іллідан.

Вищої.

Кіл'джеден Підступний наближається...

Не сюди...

&lt;А'дал спрямовує твій розум деінде.&gt;

Азерот. Невідомо.

Відпочинь. Твої брати й сестри тепер відвоюють Фортецю Бурі.

&lt;А'дал наспівує пісню битви.&gt;

en:
&lt;Master Bruised Paw bows before you.&gt;

Stone quivers and breaks beneath your fists. You have the power to move mountains, if you so desire.

There is nothing more I can teach you.

Kill ogres in Atal'Kaldan and collect 4 tomes.
4Ogre Tome of Dark Magic (4)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(246436, 0, 4, null, null));

