8Яскраве перо (8)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(249439, 0, 8, null, null));

en:
Wondrous! This should last us...

&lt;Pristy counts the appendages and scribbles in her notebook.&gt;

...at least 3 hours. Wow, we're really churning through these appendages!

What do we have here? The legends ARE true. Blackhand sacrificed his own arm to the elements. Now that he's dead, it's indistinguishable from stone. Or is it?

&lt;Khadgar utters a few incantations from the Flamebinder's Tome. The severed hand slowly clenches into a fist.&gt;

Hmmmm. Yes. &lt;name&gt;, I'll be perfectly honest with you: This thing is extremely creepy.

&lt;Janky nibbles on one of the candles.&gt;

Mhmm...mmm...fish oil...and touch of...sun blossom?

Interesting technique, yes!

These should do the job. I'm going to prepare the salve and finish my splint before making my way back to Thrallmar. Why do I have the feeling that I know what Far Seer Regulkut will say when she sees me?

&lt;Grelag sighs half-heartedly.&gt;

Thank you for your help, &lt;name&gt;. I have some of the spineleaf left over. You're welcome to take it with you. Who can tell when it will prove useful?

Okrilla sent you?  Okrilla the killa'?

&lt;Lynnore listens to your tale.&gt;

Loramus was his name?  I'm sorry to say that we have not seen your demon hunter... but we have ways of finding him.

&lt;The officer looks down at what you're offering him and his eyes light up.&gt;

Do you know what you have here? You might have just delivered some of the most significant intel of the campaign.

I will see to it personally that this gets into Lord Greymane's hands.

ua:
&lt;Офіцер дивиться на те, що ти йому пропонуєш, і його очі загоряються.&gt;

Ти розумієш, що в тебе в руках? Ти щойно $p(міг:могла) доставити чи не найважливіші розвіддані цієї кампанії.

Я особисто подбаю, щоб це потрапило до рук лорда Сивогрива.

en:
Speak with Du'gal at the Altar of Blessings in Amani'Zar.
Idol of the Depths (1)



