Ідол Глибин (1)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(265749, 0, 1, null, null));

en:
&lt;Hobart takes the mechanism from you and begins tinkering with his design.&gt;

Yes, I believe that's it. Good work, &lt;name&gt;.

As per usual I'll let you have a copy of my schematic for your personal gain.

ua:
&lt;Хобарт бере в тебе механізм і починає копирсатися зі своєю конструкцією.&gt;

Так, здається, це воно. Гарна робота, {name}.

Як завжди, віддам тобі копію своєї схеми для власного зиску.

en:
Well done!

&lt;Mack laughs hysterically for a moment.&gt;

Aww, come on now. That was funny...hic.

Ah, my doom weed. Excellent!

&lt;Apothecary Jerrod rubs his hands together greedily.&gt;

These will come in quite handy. You've done me, uh, the Lady, a fine service today, &lt;name&gt;. As promised, here is the reward that you deserve.

&lt;Skibbles looks at you in awe, then seems to realize she's staring.&gt;

Wow, you bigger and taller than kobold friends. Hello Big-Tall, my name Skibbles!

Me hear you are very brave, Big-Tall. Skibbles want to be just like you! Talk-Rock say you here to help Skibbles.

&lt;Skibbles lets out a comically large gasp, her eyes going wide as if she suddenly remembered something.&gt;

You here to take Skibbles on an adventure?? Me always want to go on adventure! Dis gonna be best day ever!

&lt;B'wizati reads the note and wipes a tear from her eye.&gt;

He may choose to forget, but I choose to remember, no matter what pain it brings me. 

At least he is safe. Loa watch over him.

ua:
&lt;Б'візаті читає записку й витирає сльозу.&gt;

Він може вирішити забути, а я вирішу пам'ятати, хоч би який біль це мені завдавало.

Принаймні він у безпеці. Нехай лоа бережуть його.

en:
&lt;B'wizati reads the note and wipes a tear from her eye.&gt;

He may choose to forget, but I choose to remember, no matter what pain it brings me. 

At least he is safe. Loa watch over him.

Mazoga? He's taken the sword? That filthy...

&lt;Trenton glowers for a moment.&gt;

At least you escaped with your life. The Lasher's bite is a vicious one.

Retrieve 8 Stolen Belongings from the Blossoming Terrace.
8Stolen Belongings (8)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(246221, 0, 8, null, null));

ua:
Поверни 8 викрадених речей із Квітучої тераси.
8Викрадені речі (8)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(246221, 0, 8, null, null));

en:
&lt;Lya reads the entirety of the message.&gt;

This scroll, this... this prophecy...

It's terrifying!

&lt;Maiev's face is bruised, her lips cracked, and her body covered in scars. She looks thin and ragged, but she moves with purpose.&gt;

For weeks they tried to break me. Amateurs!

I kept my silence. I counted the minutes, measured their steps, and listened to the voices beyond my cell.

I have been waiting for my chance to escape, and to strike back at my captors.

Now, you bring my armor AND my blade. My salvation will be followed by bloodshed.

&lt;Maiev smiles.&gt;

ua:
&lt;Обличчя Майєв вкрите синцями, губи потріскані, тіло вкрите шрамами. Вона виглядає виснаженою й обірваною, та рухається з рішучістю.&gt;

Цілі тижні вони намагалися зламати мене. Аматори!

Я мовчала. Рахувала хвилини, лічила їхні кроки й прислухалася до голосів за межами камери.

Я чекала на свій шанс утекти й дати відсіч своїм викрадачам.

І ось ти приносиш мені мій обладунок ТА мій клинок. За моїм порятунком піде кровопролиття.

&lt;Майєв посміхається.&gt;

en:
&lt;Chu'a'lor beams at you with obvious respect.&gt;

Not only are we impressed with the mental alacrity of you and your friends, but we are indebted to you, as is all of Ogri'la and the Skyguard, for helping to protect our way of life here.

And remember, &lt;name&gt;, at any time you can gather others and return to any of those larger apexis monuments to make use of them; as long as you have enough apexis shards to power it that is.

One day, this island will belong to the Horde. I can only hope that it will be free of saurok before then.

&lt;Aethas sneers.&gt;

At least they attack the Alliance, too.

Ahahahaha... boo hoo, how touching.

&lt;The condescension in the overlord's deep-throated laughter is palpable.&gt;

What did I say? Traitors! Still, I knew Deino once upon a time. She at least is a troll with honor!

I'll see to it that she finds out what happened to her brother. I'll even forget to tell her that you're the one that killed him.

&lt;Agmar fixes you with a calculated stare.&gt;

But I own you now, &lt;class&gt;!

These will do perfectly for my explanation.

&lt;Guron begins to describe the process of speaking to the spirits and how they interact with the crystal.&gt;

I believe you may have come across another type of crystal: the "leylight shard". That crystal works similarly, but resonates with different spirits.

&lt;Bertelm takes the plans from you and looks them over.&gt;

If you hadn't brought this map, I'd say you were out of your mind, but here it is, plain as day. Not only are the fel orcs here to serve the blood elves, but it appears, they've been ordered to keep us occupied.

This map raises more questions than it answers, but it gives us a better idea of what we're facing here.

ua:
&lt;Бертельм бере в тебе плани й уважно їх переглядає.&gt;

Якби ти не при$p(ніс:несла) цю мапу, я б сказав, що ти несповна розуму, але ось вона, ясна як день. Орки Скверни тут не лише служать ельфам крові — схоже, їм наказано тримати нас у зайнятості.

Ця мапа викликає більше запитань, ніж дає відповідей, але тепер ми краще уявляємо, з чим тут зіткнулися.

en:
&lt;Kronah eyes you up and down warily.&gt;

Say ahhh for me, would you young one?

&lt;Kronah peers inside your mouth.&gt;

Nice teeth you have there. Would fetch a fine price. But that's not really what you're here for, is it?

No, you're one of those who think they can handle the trials of the blood contracts, aren't you? Very well.

&lt;Berrin studies the inscriptions on the totem.&gt;

I think I can read this text... Fascinating!

Tsul'kalu, Mahamba, Pogeyan... what are these names?

ua:
&lt;Беррін вивчає написи на тотемі.&gt;

Здається, я можу прочитати цей текст... Дивовижно!

Цул'калу, Магамба, Поґеян... що це за імена?

en:
&lt;The chief listens as you describe the seer's vision.&gt;

Well, I don't know about any of that, but we could certainly use your help around here. Look at the behemoth behind me. That's the X-52...

Isn't it the most beautiful thing you've ever seen?

What's that you got there?

&lt;Gazmolf examines the talon&gt;

Hey! That definitely looks like it belonged to Thek'talon, and even if it's not who's to say otherwise? Great work, here's your cut!

ua:
Що це в тебе там?

&lt;Ґазмольф оглядає кіготь&gt;

Ей! Це точно схоже на те, що належало Тек'талону, а навіть якщо й ні — хто це доведе? Чудова робота, ось твоя частка!

en:
Collect 15 Pristine Shade Lilies and 8 Dragonhawk Fern Fronds.
15Pristine Shade Lily (15)
8Dragonhawk Fern Frond (8)



