en:
Yeah, I don't understand it... You would think that they wouldn't even be that hungry after 2 days. Murkblood...

&lt;Ronag shakes his head.&gt;

Damn they're stupid...

Well, well, well... If it isn't the grunt I sent out into the field. You're back and in one piece.

&lt;Or'barokh nods.&gt;

I knew you wouldn't let me down, soldier. You've stopped a major Illidari advance and, in doing so, earned yourself a little reward.

&lt;The witch doctor shakes his head in disbelief.&gt;

It sounds like you barely escaped Quetz'lun's underworld alive.

I'm glad that it's you out there. I don't know if I would have had the courage to deal with that situation!

ua:
&lt;Знахар недовірливо хитає головою.&gt;

Звучить так, ніби ти ледь урятува$p(вся:лась) із підземного світу Кветц'луна.

Я радий, що там саме ти. Не знаю, чи вистачило б мені відваги впоратися з таким!

en:
You found it?

&lt;Tae'thelan listens as you explain about the missing jewels.&gt;

I see. So the crown was just a vessel and the jewels are the true source of power.

ua:
Ти $p(знайшов:знайшла) її?

&lt;Тей'телан слухає твоє пояснення про зниклі самоцвіти.&gt;

Зрозуміло. Отже, корона була лише посудиною, а справжнім джерелом сили є самі самоцвіти.

en:
Stranger... I was not forthright with you. Once you drink this potion, you will forever see into the world of the dead. This recipe that you drink of is a rite of initiation for all death priests of Auchindoun. Many go mad after its effects have taken hold. Seeing the dead is ... shocking.

&lt;Nitrin puts the potion up to your lips.&gt;

Do you wish to continue?

These look to be in good shape considering how long we left them here.

&lt;Gidwin holds up the bag of herbs.&gt;

Not sure if Fiona's even still looking for these, but she'll appreciate the uh... very late gesture.

Oh, it's you!

No, I haven't found the Hidden Master yet. I probably wasted my time coming out here.

&lt;Sigh...&gt;

The spirits told me of your coming, outlander. Let us see if you are indeed the hero this land needs.

&lt;The tauren clears his throat.&gt;

Pardon me. I know I come off as a bit dramatic. It's just... well, these things have meaning for me.

Hah hah! We could hear those monkeys screamin' from over here!

&lt;Burrberry turns to Kota Kon.&gt;

Who's a pretty girl? You are!!

Well done!

&lt;Mack laughs hysterically for a moment.&gt;

Aww, come on now. That was funny...&lt;hic&gt;.

You are the help that we requested?

&lt;Althea sighs.&gt;

I suppose you will have to do.

ua:
Це тебе прислали нам на допомогу?

&lt;Алтея зітхає.&gt;

Гадаю, доведеться обійтися тобою.

