en:
&lt;Yarzill whispers.&gt;

You are doing the Netherwing a great service, &lt;name&gt;. Slowly, we will topple the Dragonmaw. From the inside a disease now grows - a disease with no cure...

Return to me tomorrow if you are interested in more work at the Dragonmaw Skyway.

You radiate the power of the Ango'rosh!

&lt;Restalaan smiles.&gt;

It is time to take this battle to Teron'gor's doorstep.

A complete success if I do say so myself, sir! Your debtors will think twice now about not paying up!

&lt;Sassy taps her pencil against her lower lip for a moment, deep in thought.&gt;

Perhaps we should increase interest rates on loans across the board?

