en:
You actually found something?!

&lt;Mama Diggs thumbs through the codex, a stern look on her face as she reads each page.&gt;

Aye, here it is. All the answers are within these pages...

&lt;Jinx examines the powder carefully for a moment.&gt;

Hmmm.

It'll take a little time. But yes, we can put this into a bomb....

&lt;The Exarch listens to your tale, his face contorting into concern, grief, and finally anger.&gt;

So Othaar has lost his way. "Socrethar" he calls himself now. At last we have our answer. I fear my capture at the hands of the Iron Horde was his doing. There may be other traitors amongst us - I must hurry back to Auchindoun and make sure we are safe.

In the meantime, I believe the Exarchs owe you a decision...

&lt;Professor Pallin looks over the demon hunter glyphs you've designed.&gt;

Huh! Apparently I don't have to hold your hand as much as I thought.

Look at this glyph you've made right here. If you flip this symbol around, and adjust the stroke width here...

Now, look closely.

&lt;Tytallo goes into a lengthy explanation concerning the thread count, weaving techniques, and other miscellaneous details that, to a tailor, are fascinating.&gt;

You still seem confused. Here, take the pattern and see for yourself. Perhaps then you'll learn a thing or two.

