en:
&lt;Finkle's helm crackles with static.&gt;

We haven't got much time. Raz looked injured. If we get to him in time there might be a chance that I can turn him back into a regular orc!

&lt;You feel a sharp pain in the back of your head and hear the jingling of coins.&gt;

Sorry about that. I figured I'd send through some gold - for your troubles and all that...

&lt;Saurfang turns to face you.&gt;

Is it blood that I smell? I regret being unable to lend assistance. How proud you must be. My chest swells just knowing what you have done.

Are there others like you? Where you come from, do more heroes exist?

It's for the best, really.  If it cannot civilly accept an invitation then it has no business attending.

&lt;Warden Treelos looks momentarily confused.&gt;

Who are you and what are you doing here?  You must get out of here quickly before it is too late!

Gather 8 Pristine Graveblossoms for Talandra Dawnsprite at Windrunner Village.
