en:
&lt;Gazlowe grimaces as he inspects the foreman's weapon.&gt;

The battery in this thing is powered by Black Blood.

I don't know how they managed to do that without the thing exploding, or worse. But this situation just got a whole lot more dangerous.

&lt;Khadgar rolls the fiery orb back and forth between his hands.&gt;

Do you know how to use this, &lt;name&gt;?

Me neither. Sometimes you just have to improvise as you go.

&lt;Kuros' face turns pale as he reads the journal; tears stream down his face.&gt;

Saruan was my master... my teacher... my mentor... I took his place among the Triumvirate only recently - after we had given up searching for him.

&lt;Kuros' face contorts in anger.&gt;

Matis...

&lt;Harry raises an eyebrow at you.&gt;

So you're like me, eh? A little eccentric.

&lt;Harry whispers.&gt;

Nobody dresses like that around here.

About those artifacts... Everyone that came into contact with that stuff has ended up dead, missing or both.

If you're still interested in learning more, I can help - but it'll cost you.

&lt;Harry winks.&gt;

You scratch my back and I'll try to not stick a dagger in yours.

&lt;You tell Gunny everything you saw in the Blood Furnace.&gt;

You brought back some loot for ol' Gunny, right?

No, no, you're right, clearly I owe you a reward for all your hard work. Not like Gunny didn't arrange all this and send you in there in the first place.

&lt;The pieces you've collected begin to glow brightly in Raelorasz' hands.&gt;

It is done.

I sense a strong presence within this prison. Let us hope it proves to be an ally.

&lt;Wrathion's brow furrows when he sees the crystal.&gt;

It is fortunate you brought this to me. Impressive that you were able to handle it while retaining your sanity. In fact... this may provide us with an opportunity.

&lt;Wrathion strokes his chin, lost in thought.&gt;

I will not mince words, &lt;name&gt;. This will certainly prove dangerous. However, I have full confidence that you are up to the task. Now, let us wield N'Zoth's own power against him.

Find the lich's notes and look for signs of Naj'kula.
Lokago's Experiment Notes (1)
Lokago's Ledger (1)
Missive from Malacrass (1)



