en:
&lt;The Eye glimmers darkly, colors swirling about its dusky surface.&gt;

Ah, the succulent thrill of life extinguished. Do you feel it, &lt;class&gt;? Do you relish it as I do?

No, I see not. You fight to protect the lives of others. Pity.

&lt;Secott places the rings on his new hand.&gt;

Good! As a goldsmith without jewelery, I was beginning to feel naked.

Very well, your lesson is that when you are mining monelite from a seam, it behaves very differently than a normal deposit.

&lt;Secott spends as little time as necessary explaining the different techniques of mining monelite seams.&gt;

Return your report to Lady Darkglen in Silvermoon City.
Ritual Site Challenge Report: Tendrils (Provided) (1)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(269817, 0, 1, null, null));

ua:
Віддай свій звіт леді Темнодолині в Місті Срібного Місяця.
Звіт про випробування ритуального місця: Щупальця (надано) (1)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(269817, 0, 1, null, null));

en:
&lt;The F.C.D. crackles with electricity.&gt;

TORPEDOED! We had everything at the water line covered, but nothing below the line. They must have snuck in beneath our defenses and then blown our warships to smithereens.

And now the rest of the Alliance fleet is nearly here...

&lt;Overlord Krom'gar takes the plans from you.&gt;

Hmm. Perhaps this grunt is more than he would appear. Perhaps this grunt is in actuality a sergeant.

Look now upon Krom'gar Sergeant &lt;name&gt;, soldiers. He has come to serve warning of a cowardly Alliance attack. An attack that we will CRUSH!

&lt;Taleris shouts to several of the blood elves at the outpost.&gt;

Get her inside and see to her wounds!

&lt;Taleris turns back to you.&gt;

She's fortunate that you found her when you did, &lt;class&gt;. I don't think she'd have lasted much longer out there.

Can you make out what she was saying?

&lt;Bzzzzzzzzzzzzt.&gt;

You're nearing the heart of their domain. There will likely be an extremely fortified door protecting the inner sanctum of the entire Defias operation. See if you can find anything that might pry it open!

I suggest a stealthy method!

&lt;You explain what happened in Mulgore.&gt;

Bah! Wretched goblins and their lust of coin!

&lt;Attika takes a deep breath to steady himself.&gt;

I... Am sorry you had to see that. I just find it so infuriating when our fight is made harder so one of those green-skinned runts can steal your last copper.

ua:
&lt;Ти розповідаєш про те, що сталося в Мулґорі.&gt;

Тьху! Мерзенні ґобліни та їхня жага до грошей!

&lt;Атикка робить глибокий вдих, щоб заспокоїтися.&gt;

Мені... шкода, що тобі довелося це побачити. Мене просто до сказу доводить, коли наша боротьба стає важчою через те, що якийсь зеленошкірий недомірок краде твій останній мідяк.

en:
Collect 4 Void Commander's Emblems from Nexus-Captain Leth'ir or Imperator Pertinax while in the Heroic world tier of Val and Naigtal.
4Void Commander's Emblem (4)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(277554, 0, 4, null, null));

ua:
Збери 4 емблеми командира Порожнечі в Капітана Нексуса Лет'їр або імператора Пертінакса на героїчному рівні світу Валу й Найґталу.
4Емблема командира Порожнечі (4)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(277554, 0, 4, null, null));

en:
&lt;Ar'syn's many eyes sparkle in the cavelight.&gt;

Though my goals today are on the philanthropic side of things, I must profess my appreciation for a good heist well-executed. Look at all of these treasures! I do so look forward to returning them to their rightful homes.

...For a finder's fee, of course. Imagine if Azj-Kahet's legendary legerdemain became some sort of folk hero?! Ugh, the very word sours on my tongue.

&lt;Alice claps excitedly.&gt;

Mr. P you're gonna be ok! Hooray!

&lt;Alice expertly places all of the parts you collected into Big Papa.&gt;

Oh, Mr. P! I knew it!

&lt;You explain your mission and relation to Daniss.&gt;

I see. Of course I'm more than willing to help. She may be a T'lara, but I do owe her my life.

However, there is a slight issue that will need to be dealt with.

ua:
&lt;Ти пояснюєш свою місію та зв'язок із Даніс.&gt;

Зрозуміло. Звісно, я охоче допоможу. Вона, може, й Т'лара, але своїм життям я завдячую саме їй.

Утім, є одна невелика проблема, яку треба владнати.

en:
Teamwork makes the dream work, or so they say. It would appear that the rhyme carries truth to it. Hmmm.

&lt;Eternus pauses for a moment in thought.&gt;

I wonder what other rhymes carry such power. That bears some future experimentation.

Collect 6 Ancient Rubble from monsters in the Storm Fields.
6Ancient Rubble (6)



