en:
&lt;You hold the handful of grubs out, steel yourself, and prepare to chew them up as a mama bird would.

Thankfully, Ikky snatches them from your hand before you can proceed.

Apparently kaliri don't do that.&gt;

That is a big egg.

&lt;Orako sniffs it.&gt;

It is big, and it smells like fish.  Maybe the big fish that made this egg is the big fish that ate my wolf!

A ledger? Wait, let me look.

&lt;Valeera reaches out and begins thumbing through the tome's pages.&gt;

This is the key!

ua:
Гросбух? Стривай, дай гляну.

&lt;Валіра простягає руку й починає гортати сторінки фоліанта.&gt;

Ось він, ключ!

