en:
&lt;Another wave of euphoria, mixed with some pain, crashes through your mind as you approach the creature.&gt;

Good... good! So that you know I am being fair, I will first give you your reward as promised.

And then you will willingly hand me the key.

Bring 13 Dirty Darters to Brinedrinker Gills.
13Dirty Darter (13)



