en:
Ooh, these are nice.  Now, leave me alone with my gizzards.  I've got studying to do!

&lt;Agnes starts to poke the gizzards with a stick.&gt;

Yes, very interesting.  Very interesting indeed...

Oh! I say!

&lt;Ashton shudders and coughs&gt;

A bit less hearthbloom next time, Marten, but that did just the trick. Well done both of you.

Collect 6 Harmonious Fronds in the outskirts of Har'kuai.
6Harmonious Lash (6)



