ua:
Збери 15 трохи магічних кристалів у своєму районі.
15Трохи магічний кристал (15)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(251273, 0, 15, null, null));




Видано предмет: 

Локатор трохи магічних кристалів (1)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon2').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(251492, 0, 0, null, null));

en:
These are from Emery, I assume?

&lt;Meliana blushes.&gt;

That dummy. Gotta admire his persistence, though...

I hope these weren't too heavy for a small brul such as yourself to carry.

But these will be more than enough to show you a suitable design.

&lt;Jabrul begins to carve one of the jewels into a design, instructing you how it's done as he works.&gt;

ua:
Сподіваюся, вони не були надто важкими, щоб нести їх такому малому, як ти.

Але цього більш ніж достатньо, щоб показати тобі гідний ескіз.

&lt;Джабрул починає гранити один із самоцвітів, пояснюючи тобі кожен крок роботи.&gt;

en:
What have you brought today, Shadowblade?

&lt;Filius examines the ancient tome.&gt;

This book... it changes everything!

ua:
Що ти $p(приніс:принесла) сьогодні, Тіньовий Клинку?

&lt;Філій оглядає прадавній фоліант.&gt;

Ця книга... вона все змінює!

en:
Collect 5 Dark-Ley Coalescence by completing any Void Assault in Eversong or Zul'Aman.
5Dark-Ley Coalescence (5)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(274577, 0, 5, null, null));

ua:
Збери 5 згустків темної лей-лінії, виконавши будь-який напад Порожнечі у «Вічноспіві» або Зул'Амані.
5Згусток темної лей-лінії (5)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(274577, 0, 5, null, null));

en:
What's this? A letter from Mayor Pare?

&lt;Constable Framer reads Evelyn's letter.&gt;

Well... it appears we were... mistaken.

&lt;The Archmage looks damp and uncomfortable.&gt;

I apologize for the conditions here, &lt;name&gt;. I had no choice. I summoned this tower at the optimal confluence of arcane energies. My hope is to finish my work here before all my books get musty.

So then! Let's get to it.

Poor Monty. Ever since the Gnomeregan incident, he hasn't been the same. That boy has never seen an ocean in his life, let alone being some kind of pirate.

&lt;Nipsy sighs.&gt;

At least he keeps the flow of twitching critters coming.

As much as I dislike bringing such disease-ridden things into the village, they may give us an advantage over our foes.

&lt;The chieftain gestures to Sage Aeire and waves dismissively at the pelts.&gt;

While she is preparing the pelts, there is one other element we need to create the cloak.

I knew it'd be fine! Perfectly safe to handle. 

&lt;Jazz coughs.&gt;

I'll name you on whatever patent I file, promise.

Orweyna's Belongings found (4)
Har'old (1)
Wooden Spoon (1)
Bone Comb (1)
Bird Whistle (1)



