ua:
Знайдено речі Орвейни (4)
Гар'олд (1)
Дерев'яна ложка (1)
Кістяний гребінь (1)
Пташиний свисток (1)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(256138, 0, 1, null, null));
WH.ge('icon-list-icon2').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(256143, 0, 1, null, null));
WH.ge('icon-list-icon3').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(256144, 0, 1, null, null));
WH.ge('icon-list-icon4').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(256145, 0, 1, null, null));

en:
&lt;Captain Kosak forces a smile at you.&gt;

Don't worry about me. Should be ok now that big hero killed the spider queen.

Can get reinforcements through safely now.

ua:
&lt;Капітан Косак силує усмішку.&gt;

Не хвилюйся за мене. Тепер усе має бути гаразд, коли великий герой убив королеву павуків.

Тепер підкріплення зможе безпечно пройти.

en:
&lt;Hobart Grapplehammer examines you closely.&gt;

This is fantastic! You're currently suffering a moderate amount of internal bleeding, but the prototype X-52 Personnel Armor performed just as I predicted under extreme levels of repeated blunt force.

The X-52 doesn't have a scratch on it!

You're back! I was worried. Tell me everything.

&lt;Faerin looks you over.&gt; 

Those spiders didn't... do anything to you, did they? Didn't... plant eggs under your cloak or something? 

&lt;Faerin shivers.&gt;

So there is hope for my sisters?

&lt;Lurielle looks away from you, then down at the ground.&gt;

I feel guilty for not thinking of the pendant sooner. We might have saved even more of the sisters.

&lt;Vekax squawks in glee as you present him with proof of his enemies' demise.&gt;

Yes, that will show Skettis that we Outcasts will not take their punishment lying down.  Here is the reward I promised you.  I can arrange for more, should you provide me with additional feathers.

&lt;This quest can be repeated up to Honored reputation.&gt;

It is embarrassing to have been kidnapped by Arnak again. I heard the fighting outside. Did you kill him?

&lt;The shaman looks sad for just a moment.&gt;

I am happy to be free once more. Now, how can I help you, &lt;class&gt;?

WHAT?! That's impossible! We've perfected the blight. It has a one-hundred percent lethality.

&lt;The apothecary wrings her hands, concern crossing her unliving visage. Clearly frustrated, she continues in an angry tone.&gt;

This is just really odd. Hand me that flask, &lt;class&gt;. I'm not going to be known as the apothecary that ruined everything!

The Forest Heart! It's corrupted!

&lt;The great ancient creaks as its immense limbs begin to perform a ritual.&gt;

Stand back, &lt;name&gt;, I will try to cleanse the heart before all is lost!

&lt;The troll looks into the package.&gt;

You have my thanks.  You may tell your young dwarven friend that I am not sad.  I am waiting.  For you.

I have identified you as the most promising &lt;race&gt; here in this strange town.  I have a task for you, if you would be willing to take it.

ua:
&lt;Тролька заглядає в пакунок.&gt;

Дякую тобі. Можеш переказати своєму юному другові-дворфу, що я не сумна. Я чекаю. На тебе.

Я визначила, що ти $p(найперспективніший:найперспективніша) {race} тут, у цьому дивному місті. У мене є для тебе завдання, якщо ти $p(готовий:готова) його взяти.

en:
&lt;The advisor looks down at what you're offering her and then looks around nervously, straining to give you a rictus grin. She continues in hushed tones.&gt;

Do you know what you have here? You have kept the Alliance from getting their grubby little hands on some rather delicate information.

I will see to it personally that this is safely filed away.

ua:
&lt;Радниця зазирає в те, що ти їй пропонуєш, потім нервово озирається довкола, силувано розтягуючи губи в посмішці. Вона продовжує притишеним голосом.&gt;

Ти розумієш, що зараз тримаєш у руках? Завдяки тобі ці делікатні відомості не потрапили до брудних лапок Альянсу.

Я особисто простежу, щоб це надійно зберігалося.

en:
&lt;Gazlowe fishes around in his pouch before producing a single gold piece.&gt;

Err... looks like I'm a little short. Personal bodyguard fees really add up!

I'll give you a proper cut when we get back to your garrison. Come on, you know I'm good for it!

&lt;Granny Scribbles gestures around to the room.&gt;

Not all stoneheads bad, seems like.

Still, little kobold need know what happen. What can happen.

&lt;Mazoga tilts his head back and inhales the clumps of mysterious material. His eyes flash.&gt;

Powerful stuff, mon...ah, if ya could see what I see now...mebbe you go try it yaself sometime.

The spirits call...

Collect Tetla'ketl's Conjuring Crest and Tsssaani's Scales of Summoning and then bring them back to Scrollmaster Ruma so that he can create the curative scroll. For real this time.
Tetla'ketl's Conjuring Crest (1)
Tsssaani's Scales of Summoning (1)
 Reagents delivered and curative scroll created (1)



