en:
&lt;Sylnaria carefully examines the golden egg.&gt;

Ugh! Did a duck gnaw on this? My poor darling, don't you worry--we'll polish you up to a bright shine soon enough!

Thank you for your help, &lt;name&gt;.

Collect 8 Feathered Trinkets in the mire.
8Feathered Trinket (8)



