en:
&lt;Fizzcrank listens to your report, looking somewhat relieved.&gt;

I should've gone with them. We might've been able to complete the mission without losing any pilots.

Tailspin is right, though, we have you to thank for what you've been able to salvage. Your efforts may just make the difference in the fight against the Nerubians.

&lt;Kazit makes some tallies in his notebook.&gt;

Yeah, that's lookin' about right. Here's your pay.

Hey, don't give me that look. I said an honest wage, not a good one!

&lt;Bzzzzzzzzzzzzt.&gt;

Your exploits have gained quite the following in the intelligence community, &lt;name&gt;. Many top members of SI:7 have been earnestly watching you infiltrate the Deadmines through their own Stormwind Communicators.

Mathias Shaw himself wants to speak with you! I'll transfer you over momentarily.

ua:
&lt;Бззззт.&gt;

Твої подвиги здобули чимало прихильників серед розвідників, &lt;name&gt;. Багато високопосадовців SI:7 уважно стежили через власні штормовійські комунікатори, як ти проникаєш у Мертві копальні.

Сам Матіас Шоу хоче поговорити з тобою! Зараз я тебе до нього перемкну.

en:
Oh, hey, that's a giant conch, right? Let me see that.

&lt;Palta flips the conch over and pulls the innards out by the antennae.&gt;

That's the stuff. Look at it! Full-slime, all scales, this one is going to be great.

I'll prepare this for the meal tonight, that should lift some spirits. Nothing like a slice of spireshell to remind you of home.

Thanks for bringing this.

&lt;Palta nods at you.&gt;

ua:
О, гей, це ж велетенська мушля, так? Дай подивлюся.

&lt;Палта перевертає мушлю й витягає нутрощі за вусики.&gt;

Ось воно. Ти лише поглянь! Уся в слизі, вся в лусці — оце буде щось!

Приготую це на вечерю сьогодні, це має підняти дух. Немає нічого кращого за шматочок спіральної мушлі, щоб згадати про дім.

Дякую, що прин$p(іс:есла) це.

&lt;Палта киває тобі.&gt;

en:
&lt;Brugar utters a stream of foul dwarven words.&gt;

No entrances? None?

No, of course it couldn't be that easy. Well, I suppose there's no avoiding a foray into the city proper. My boys'll never get back to their real work.

Retrieve 3 overdue books from around Farstrider Hold and return them to the library.
Herbalist's Handbook: Eversong Medicinals (1)
Index of Ranger Corps Recipes Vol. VII (1)
Songs for the Silver Streams (1)
 Return books to the Farstrider Library (1)
 Examine Taemin's favorite book (1)



