en:
Teamwork makes the dream work, or so they say. It would appear that the rhyme carries truth to it. Hmmm.

&lt;Eternus pauses for a moment in thought.&gt;

I wonder what other rhymes carry such power. That bears some future experimentation.

Well, well, well... If it isn't the soldier I sent out into the field. You're back and in one piece.

&lt;Yoregar nods.&gt;

I knew you wouldn't let me down, soldier. You've stopped a major Illidari advance and, in doing so, earned yourself a little reward.

Collect 5 Smuggled Goods around Sunsail Anchorage.
5Smuggled Goods (5)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(249517, 0, 5, null, null));

ua:
Збери 5 контрабандних товарів навколо Причалу Сонячних Вітрил.
5 контрабандних товарів (5)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(249517, 0, 5, null, null));

en:
Good work!

&lt;Sef looks introspective for a moment.&gt;

I just realized I never told you my plan.

I'll file these away for now.  Maybe we can experiment later.

&lt;Jasper looks over at you.&gt;

Yeah, you'll do.

&lt;Wyrmbane listens to your report.&gt;

The news of this C'Thraxxi is troubling, but you did well in befriending the local population. This likely won't be the last time we'll have to depend upon them.

Well done, &lt;name&gt;.

&lt;Again, Raggaran appears calmer.&gt;

You've done well, stranger.

I'm sorry you had to see me like that.  Thank you for killing the quilboar, but maybe you should leave before I fly into another one of my rages.

What's this ya brought me?

&lt;Rolm looks over the broken power core and arcs an eyebrow. You ask him if he thinks it could be used against the naga.&gt;

Actually, I believe it could. But probably not in the way ya think.

ua:
Що це ти мені прин$p(іс:есла)?

&lt;Рольм оглядає розбите джерело живлення й підіймає брову. Ти питаєш, чи можна, на його думку, використати це проти наг.&gt;

Власне, гадаю, можна. Але, мабуть, не так, як ти собі це уявляєш.

en:
I see... their eyes are open

&lt;Delaris smiles with bemusement.&gt;

Maybe I'll keep Impsy around after all. He's got a lot to teach me...

Mmf! Mm- mff!!

&lt;You remove his gag.&gt;

THEY GOT THAELIN!!

Well, sir, I have to say that you went about that particular business with a bit of zeal.

&lt;The sergeant looks at you warily.&gt;

Anyway, if you don't mind, I'll be taking my machete back now. It looks dull and we wouldn't want you to accidentally slip and carve me up, too.

&lt;Overlord Agmar looks over the document.&gt;

Is this what I think it is? With the information contained within these pages we will CRUSH the Anub'ar assault!

You have done well to bring this document to me, &lt;name&gt;. Perhaps you will be allowed to watch or even participate in the final battle at Angrathar! LOK'TAR!

Collect 100 Otherworldly Sparks of War in Val, while in War Mode.
100Otherworldly Spark of War (100)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(275134, 0, 100, null, null));

ua:
Збери 100 Потойбічних Іскор війни у Val у режимі війни.
100Otherworldly Spark of War (100)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(275134, 0, 100, null, null));

en:
Collect a Threshadon Tooth Necklace from the gnarldin at Akil'zon's Reach.
Threshadon Tooth Necklace (1)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(249271, 0, 1, null, null));

ua:
Збери намисто із зубів трешадона в гнарлдінів у Краю Акіл'зони.
Намисто із зубів трешадона (1)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(249271, 0, 1, null, null));

en:
Well blow me down!  Now there's something ya don't see too often.

&lt;Yancey reaches out and shakes your hand.&gt;

Welcome aboard, &lt;name&gt;.  Plunder and booty await ye.

ua:
Хай мені грім! Таке не щодень побачиш.

&lt;Янсі простягає руку й тисне тобі руку.&gt;

Ласкаво просимо на борт, &lt;name&gt;. На тебе чекають здобич і скарби.

en:
Daniss sent you? Is everything alright?

&lt;You explain the plan and need for scales.&gt;

Hmmm... scales you say.

ua:
Тебе прислала Данісс? У неї все гаразд?

&lt;Ти пояснюєш план і потребу в лусці.&gt;

Хм... кажеш, луска.

en:
&lt;Zignibble's voice squawks over the speakers.&gt;

Is that you, &lt;name&gt;? Still alive? You aren't trashing my explosive stockpiles are you?

Hmmm... you say you found a clear crystal pendant. That makes sense. A perfect prism would refract the gaze of the basilisk. Maybe we can use this to our advantage. Time to drop some science!

ua:
&lt;Голос Зіґніббла верещить із динаміків.&gt;

Це ти, &lt;name&gt;? Ще живий? Сподіваюся, ти не нищиш мої запаси вибухівки?

Гммм... кажеш, у тебе прозорий кришталевий кулон. Це логічно. Ідеальна призма заломить погляд василіска. Можливо, ми обернемо це собі на користь. Час творити науку!

en:
So it was a demon?  Those miners never seen a demon before?  We're in the Blasted Lands, mon!  Demons are everywhere!

&lt;Tak'arili sighs.&gt;

Ah well... let's get on to da good stuff, shall we?

You got all the pieces!

&lt;Timothy looks over each piece and nods his head.&gt;

Yeah, I can fix this. No prob, bob.

ua:
Ти $p(зібрав:зібрала) усі частини!

&lt;Тімоті оглядає кожну частину й киває головою.&gt;

Ага, я можу це полагодити. Жодних проблем.

en:
That's a big shell! Like the sheen on it, too. Really catches the light, especially now that we can see the sun directly.

You know what I haven't made in a while? With all this fighting and barely surviving? Jewelry. I miss it! We used to find all kinds of things to wear dropped by your ships.

&lt;Palta smashes the shell into many pieces and holds two irregular shards up to her ears.&gt;

Well, how do I look?

&lt;Do you answer?&gt;

ua:
Оце велика мушля! І блиск у неї гарний. Так і виграє на світлі, особливо тепер, коли ми можемо бачити сонце безпосередньо.

Знаєш, чого я вже давно не робила? З усіма цими боями та ледь виживанням? Прикраси. Так за ними скучила! Раніше ми знаходили всілякі речі, що падали з ваших кораблів, і носили їх.

&lt;Палта розбиває мушлю на дрібні шматки й прикладає два неправильної форми уламки до вух.&gt;

Ну, як я виглядаю?

&lt;Чи відповідаєш ти?&gt;

en:
&lt;Krasus listens intently as you relate your battle with Halion, and then his eyes go wide at the mention of Deathwing.&gt;

We owe you a debt of gratitude, mortal, for driving the invaders from the Sanctum. But this news of the Destroyer is troubling beyond words. I have much to discuss with the other members of the Accord.

Take these as a token of my thanks, as you gird yourselves for the coming storm.

Oh, this is great stuff. That's some landscape up there! Let me just get this information written down...

&lt;Didi begins to scribble some notes on some blueprint paper.&gt;

That should do it. As with all generators, you'll need to use local materials for it, so whatever you can find on that planet should work.

&lt;You recount your experience at the shrine with Seshuli.&gt;

Traveled ta Atal'Dazar, eh? Dat place is quite amazing from what I remember.

Still though, great job on repairing de shrine.

ua:
&lt;Ти розповідаєш Сешулі про те, що сталося зі святилищем.&gt;

Б$p(ув:ула) в Атал'Дазарі, кажеш? Наскільки я пам'ятаю, дивовижне місце.

І все ж, чудова робота з ремонтом святилища.

