en:
&lt;Timothy leafs through the manual.&gt;

They're using ragveil as a base for the poison? No, that can't be right. Ragveil has no toxic properties.

Including ragveil in a poison is like a rogue wielding two maces. Sure, you can do it, but it isn't true to the essence of your calling! I just can't understand...

&lt;Timothy clears his throat.&gt;

I mean, thank you for fetching these for me. I'll try out the poison as soon as time permits.

&lt;Kronah eyes you up and down warily.&gt;

Say ahhh for me, would you lad?

&lt;Kronah peers inside your mouth.&gt;

Nice teeth you have there. Would fetch a fine price. But that's not really what you're here for, is it?

No, you're one of those who think they can handle the trials of the blood contracts, aren't you? Very well.

&lt;Marmaduke seems to want to follow you off of the island to new adventures. 

He grips his favorite toy in his mouth, his tail wagging happily.

Hopefully, this is the start of a beautiful new friendship.&gt;

&lt;Chen nods.&gt;

Good work, &lt;name&gt;. You're not bad in combat.

What do you say we team up for the next part?

&lt;Mazoga grins as he takes the sword from you in both hands.&gt;

Didn't like ya much, eh? More in this world craves blood than just trolls, mon.

Let's find the other blade...

Fetch a Vial of Quicksilver, a Flask of Dragon's Blood, and a Bottle of Magister's Reserve from the vendors at Goldenmist Village.
Vial of Quicksilver (1)
Flask of Dragon's Blood (1)
Bottle of Magister's Reserve (1)



