en:
Oh how gorgeous. Very interesting.

&lt;Ta'xera inspects the necklace closely.&gt;

Where did they get this material? I've not seen it in a long time. There is much to learn from it.

&lt;The specialist steps back a bit when presented with the parts.&gt;

Ew, those things are totally gross!

Okay, okay, hand them over and I'll see what I can do. I probably should have had you take them to a priest first for purification.

Gold! The rogues, thieves, and cutthroats are gonna start rollin' in.

&lt;Nikki looks over at Vanessa and says in a whisper.&gt;

Maybe we'll even get some unemployed Defias to sign up. Too soon?

ua:
Золото! Розбійники, злодії та головорізи посиплються один за одним.

&lt;Ніккі позирає на Ванессу і шепоче.&gt;

Може, навіть якісь безробітні з Братства Справедливості запишуться. Чи ще зарано так жартувати?

