en:
These should do just fine...

&lt;Anderhol deftly twists the stalks, collecting their slick fluids in a tiny vial.&gt;

There we go, now it's time to get down to business.

&lt;There is a note in Slinkin's death grip.&gt;

Chased into a dead end. Hidden for now, but they know I'm here. It won't be long until they find me.

The miners work tirelessly to unearth the strange ore that fuels the Scourge war machines. There is much banter. The language of death confounds me, but I have been able to identify commonly uttered sounds and phrases. The word "Yogg-Saron" is said with great contempt and is usually followed by loud outbursts. They refer to the ore as "saronite." Meaning?

&lt;Calderax grumbles something under his breath before proceeding with a very well practiced speech.&gt;

Here are your trophies, as promised. Use them when crafting your own equipment or submitting Crafting Orders and the gear will be comparable in power to what I offer. It is perfect if you are looking for something highly specific or imbued with a certain embellishment... and are willing to put in some extra work.

Questions? Take them to the Artisan's Market.

A note written by Westwind? Why didn't you say so?

&lt;Arete tears the letter from your hand to read it.&gt;

The fool! He's actually here?!

&lt;The lord-commander laughs.&gt;

This is new information. I wonder how he imagines that he's going to conquer the world once he's taken down the Lich King? Not that he could accomplish either task in his wildest imaginings.

&lt;Keeshan takes the bundle from you and opens it.&gt;

My bow... and knife! Where did you...

Jade's amulet... My darling Jade.

&lt;Keeshan picks up his red headband.&gt;

We got orcs to kill.

ua:
&lt;Кішан бере в тебе згорток і відкриває його.&gt;

Мій лук... і ніж! Де ти їх...

Амулет Джейд... Моя люба Джейд.

&lt;Кішан бере свою червону пов'язку на голову.&gt;

Нас чекають орки на вбивство.

en:
What is this? You... rescuing me?

&lt;Erunak smiles at you.&gt;

This will take some getting used to.

&lt;The overlord listens to your report.&gt;

Excellent news! Holding the line against the Legion's infernals was taking too many resources. Not that I expected my men to break, but they were greatly strained.

You have proven your worth to the Horde this day. The Kor'kron guard would be honored to fight by your side anytime.

With the prince defeated, the Scourge presence in Borean Tundra is broken. I have no illusions that they will stay away for long, which is why I must focus on preparing Durm to lead the villagers on their way to Icemist.

&lt;The chieftain shakes his head slowly.&gt;

For all the disagreements I've had with Durm, I trust his judgment and his abilities. I cannot bring myself to abandon Taunka'le, so I will defend it until I am slain.

A-ha! Soul Remnants!

&lt;Khadgar cradles the Remnants briefly and focuses intently upon them.&gt;

There, now you and your companions may access the upper level of the Citadel directly.

&lt;Wulfred peers into the box.&gt;

This... this is not like what I expected.  I had thought it would be a... a...

&lt;His eyes glaze over.&gt;

Ahem!  I'm sorry.  I'm not sure what came over me.  I'll be sending this south, to the Explorers' League Digsite in the Cape.  Maybe they'll know what to do with it...

ua:
&lt;Вулфред заглядає в скриньку.&gt;

Це... це не те, чого я очікував. Я думав, там буде... щось...

&lt;Його погляд затуманюється.&gt;

Кхм! Пробач. Не розумію, що на мене найшло. Відправлю це на південь, на розкопки Ліги Дослідників на мисі. Може, там знатимуть, що з цим робити...

en:
It work so good!

You see lightning smash that oracle guy? So good!

&lt;Zepik rubs his hands together and chuckles maniacally.&gt;

&lt;Tiffany examines your work.&gt;

I see. I would have ground this facet's angle differently... but your work is passable.

Why don't I write down my design for you. That way, you can try to be more like me.

ua:
&lt;Тіффані оглядає твою роботу.&gt;

Зрозуміло. Я б зробила кут цієї грані інакше... але твоя робота цілком прийнятна.

Запишу тобі свій ескіз. Так ти зможеш спробувати стати більше схожим на мене.

en:
That's the charter tube, alright. I guess you'd like to know what all the fuss is about, eh?

&lt;Soggy lets out a long sigh as he un-caps the tube.&gt;

Might as well get it over with.

What have you brought today, Slayer?

&lt;Vahu examines the ancient tome.&gt;

This book... it changes everything!

ua:
Що ти $p(приніс:принесла) сьогодні, Вбивце?

&lt;Ваху оглядає прадавній фоліант.&gt;

Ця книга... вона все змінює!

en:
...Torn limb from limb!? Well, I'd almost feel bad but the burning hatred gets in the way. She got what she deserved.

&lt;Corporal Teegan takes the Bramblestaff and snaps it over his knee.&gt;

Problem solved.

&lt;The Warchief begins to read the letter.&gt;

So the blood elves finally took care of their little problem.  It is no surprise that it took your help as well as that of an entire Forsaken regiment to get the job done.

&lt;The Warchief breaks into laughter.&gt;

I suppose there's no stopping this.  In the end we need them just as much as they need us.

Excellent!

&lt;Ta'mil mutters an incantation under his breath as he cradles the platinum nuggets in his hands. A bright light bursts out from between his fingers, fading away as he finishes. Turning to you, he smiles as he holds out what looks like a pair of platinum eyeballs.&gt;

I see you. I thank you for dis. I suppose dis means de next sunset will be my last.

As for your training...

&lt;Ta'mil picks up a large chunk of rock with platinum veins, and shows you his secrets to harvesting the metal.&gt;

Ah, a great find.

&lt;Itanu takes the conch from you and flips it over. Before you can see it, he has a small knife in hand. The conch is quickly speared, the slug within removed.&gt;

Most delightful! It would ruin it to touch fire. This... is a delicacy. It must be savored.

&lt;Itanu closes his eyes and breathes deeply, then devours the snail in a single gulp.&gt;

Hm, mm. Slimy, oddly rough on the insides. 

Magnificent.

ua:
Ах, чудова знахідка.

&lt;Ітану бере в тебе мушлю й перевертає її. Ти не встигаєш і глянути, як у нього вже з'являється маленький ніж. Мушлю швидко проколено, слимака витягнуто.&gt;

Вишукано! Вогонь лише зіпсував би її. Це… делікатес. Його треба смакувати.

&lt;Ітану заплющує очі, глибоко вдихає й проковтує равлика одним ковтком.&gt;

Гм, мм. Слизький, а всередині дивно шорсткий.

Чудово.

en:
Harvest 10 pieces of Mouthwatering Crab Meat from the crabs upriver.
10Mouthwatering Crab Meat (10)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(259471, 0, 10, null, null));

