Follow up on the advertisement with Mirvedon at Falconwing Square in Silvermoon City.
Artisan's Consortium Flyer (1)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(257194, 0, 1, null, null));

ua:
Дізнайся більше про оголошення в Мірведона на площі Соколиного Крила в місті Сільвермун.
Листівка Консорціуму майстрів (1)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(257194, 0, 1, null, null));

en:
That damned sinkhole must be directly connected to Azjol-Nerub. This is worse than I thought.

&lt;Juktok pauses to think for a moment.&gt;

Seek and destroy... That'll be the next course of action.

You found someone trapped up there? And others were dead? Good thing you had that torch! 

&lt;Bobby peers at the etching.&gt;

I don't recognize this text. I'll show it to Preservationist Kathos. Hopefully whatever it says can help us figure out what this group is after.

&lt;Gort holds the head up and stares into its dead eyes.&gt;

I told you we'd get you...

Here's your reward, &lt;class&gt;. That's one less headache for us to worry about.

What's this you've brought me?

&lt;Instructor Ulooaka looks over the broken power core and arcs an eyebrow. You ask him if he thinks it could be used against the naga.&gt;

Actually, I believe it could. But probably not in the way you think.

ua:
Що це ти мені прин$p(іс:есла)?

&lt;Інструктор Улуака оглядає розбите джерело живлення й підіймає брову. Ти питаєш, чи можна, на його думку, використати це проти наг.&gt;

Власне, гадаю, можна. Але, мабуть, не так, як ти собі це уявляєш.

en:
What? Give that here, this instant! Ag'tor is correct, these are arcane runes. They're scouting out magical sites? Experimenting with the arcane arts? This is a marked departure from thousands of years of night elven history.

Hmph! The idea that they will achieve any competence in this field - even those who once counted themselves among the highborne - is absurd.

&lt;Malynea puts aside the scroll dismissively, but her face is furrowed with concern.&gt;

Azik must have seen something in you. I will trust his judgment, for n-

&lt;Reshad is interrupted as a warm gust of wind surges through the hut.&gt;

Oh dear... they've arrived.

Ears of the Burning Blade?

&lt;Captain Pentigast smiles.&gt;

Well done, &lt;class&gt;. This is just a shadow of what will soon become of that vile cult!

It was there? You found some?

&lt;Alard takes the crate and opens it. He reels back from the smell.&gt;

Yep, that's the stuff alright. By the light, does that reek.

Collect 8 Abductor's Marks from the voidwalkers of Masters' Perch.
8Abductor's Mark (8)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(244171, 0, 8, null, null));

ua:
Збери 8 Міток викрадача в ходоків Порожнечі на Виступі Майстрів.
8Мітка викрадача (8)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(244171, 0, 8, null, null));

en:
What have you brought today, Deathlord?

&lt;Illanna examines the ancient tome.&gt;

This book... it changes everything!

ua:
Що ти $p(приніс:принесла) сьогодні, Володарю Смерті?

&lt;Іланна оглядає прадавній фоліант.&gt;

Ця книга... вона все змінює!

en:
A newly scribed blessing at the back of the book you say?

&lt;The agent glances over your shoulder as you flip to the page at the end.&gt;

Damn it all! That's the high abbot's handwriting! I'd stake your life on it.

&lt;You introduce yourself to Kurun.&gt;

So the sons of iron are your enemies as well?

My forces have the iron dwarves pinned inside their city, but we could use help in pressing the attack. Will you aid us?

&lt;Azik looks you up and down.&gt;

Azik is betting you are someone of importance to your people.

Come closer, friend. Azik could use your help.

What is this?

&lt;Wingminder Goja looks between you and the pterrordax and grins.&gt;

Oh, I get it!

&lt;You tell Anduin about Xal'atath and N'Zoth. His expression darkens.&gt;

This is grim news, champion.

The Alliance stands on the threshold of victory. If the Banshee Queen has learned of a new weapon, she will use it to keep the war going indefinitely.

&lt;Calder grasps the gigantic heart in both hands, squeezing it and listening to the valves slurp and squish.&gt;

&lt;His pale mask of a face splits open into an enormous, childlike grin.&gt;

It is so very important to love one's work, wouldn't you agree, &lt;name&gt;?

