&lt;Gnomus hungrily grabs at the spleens.&gt;

Here's your coin as promised. I'll call for you if I need more spleens.

So delicious... I dare say that they are 'spleendid!'

Teamwork makes the dream work, or so they say. It would appear that the rhyme carries truth to it. Hmmm.

&lt;Eternus pauses for a moment in thought.&gt;

I wonder what other rhymes carry such power. That bears some future experimentation.

Was she able to translate it?

&lt;You hand the book over to Samuel and he begins to read it.&gt;

This is incredible. This earthen was able to create jewels with light at special shrines he built. I mean, he mentions building several of them all over the world but...

&lt;Samuel pulls out a few maps and begins scanning them.&gt;

&lt;The captain breathes a sigh of relief.&gt;

Well, that should take some of the pressure off of us.

&lt;name&gt;, time and again you have proven yourself invaluable to Westguard Keep and the Alliance at large. Pick something from the treasury, boy! It's the least we can do!

