en:
&lt;The goblin peers inside.&gt;

Whaaaaaa?!?

I'm... I'm going to have to send this to... to Flem... in the south.  He'll know what to do with it.

A hero of the Horde, eh?

&lt;Garrosh sniffs at the air around you.&gt;

Fear...

&lt;Garrosh spits.&gt;

You won't last long.

You're back.

 &lt;Keara winces from her injuries.&gt;

Your timing coulda been better.

ua:
Ти повернув$p(ся:лася).

 &lt;Кіра морщиться від поранень.&gt;

Тобі б прийти трохи раніше.

en:
A-ha!

&lt;Laurith sprinkles the moth pollen onto the bloodspore carpels.&gt;

Look at that!

Good. Their blood is on Hellscream's hands. Send enough of them back to Orgrimmar in a body bag and the populace of the Horde might react.

&lt;Lord Fallowmere laughs.&gt;

Who am I kidding? They're monsters!

Oh yes, that seems to be everything.

&lt;Kharmeera takes the components from you and assembles the rod.&gt;

Now, let's see what I can share with you.

ua:
О так, здається, це все.

&lt;Кармеера бере в тебе компоненти й збирає жезл.&gt;

А тепер подивимося, чим я можу з тобою поділитися.

