en:
The matron mother?

&lt;The archmage's face goes red as he chokes out a cough and looks around surreptitiously.&gt;

Yes, of course. Anything for Malevolence.

ua:
Верховна мати?

&lt;Архімаг червоніє, притлумлюючи кашель, і скоса озирається довкола.&gt;

Так, авжеж. Для Зловтіхи — все, що завгодно.

en:
So the quartermaster sent you?

&lt;Gil seems relieved.&gt;

To be honest, we're running a bit behind here and we're going to need some help making our goals.

&lt;Gil shudders.&gt;

None of the men want to brave the wrath of Captain Adams.

I'm startin' ta think you may be as good an archaeologist as I am. But don't let that go ta yer head, lad.

&lt;Brann lets out a chuckle and begins to study the artifacts you brought him.&gt;

Aye, that's it! I know where the chamber is. And once I've reassembled tha key, we're in business.

ua:
Я вже починаю думати, що з тебе археолог не гірший за мене. Тільки не задирай носа, хлопче.

&lt;Бранн посміюється й береться вивчати принесені тобою артефакти.&gt;

Аге, ось воно! Я знаю, де ця кімната. І щойно складу ключ докупи, ми беремося до справи.

en:
You're certain nobody saw you?  Good.

&lt;Dar'toon listens to your recount of the information you saw.&gt;

Hmph... fairly harmless stuff.  Either the Alliance are foolish enough to NOT be planning something against us... or they're hiding their information better than I expected.  Either way, well done, soldier.

&lt;Alexi holds Weldon's head up to his face and begins speaking.&gt;

You no-good, backstabbing son-of-a-goat! Your greed is only surpassed by my own!

As for you my peasant friend, you have served me well. Here are your just rewards!

&lt;Recognizing at once the nature of the gift, Draaka begins to weep.&gt;

Oh, &lt;name&gt;. Thank you for this gift! It means more than you could know.

He hasn't forgotten...

Is that the cluckbox from that rust-blooded Unit 35? I hate that thing!

&lt;Vera grabs the box from you and throws it to the ground. She stomps on it a few times, then once more for good measure.&gt;

Someone programmed that thing to wake up the island at dawn every morning! Who does that?

&lt;Vera glares in the direction of the city.&gt;

If you see that thing show up again, smash it good for me.

ua:
Це кудкудахбокс того іржавокровного Зразка-35? Ненавиджу цю штуку!

&lt;Віра вихоплює в тебе коробку й кидає на землю. Вона кілька разів топче її ногою, а тоді ще раз про всяк випадок.&gt;

Хтось запрограмував цю штуку будити острів щоранку на світанку! Кому таке спало на думку?

&lt;Віра похмуро дивиться в бік міста.&gt;

Якщо ще раз побачиш цю штуку, розтрощ її як слід заради мене.

en:
This not just any egg. Mother egg.

&lt;Nebb takes the egg from you. He holds it with reverence.&gt;

With this, grubs not just survive. They thrive. Thank you. We protect.

Collect 50 Tideborne Dubloons.
50Tideborne Doubloon (50)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(249686, 0, 50, null, null));

ua:
Збери 50 припливних дублонів.
50Припливний дублон (50)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(249686, 0, 50, null, null));

en:
&lt;You explain to Ghaliri what has happened up to this point.&gt;

It would seem that Jin'do has survived, and he is rallying his brothers to once again summon Hakkar into this world.  It was good of you to come to speak with me.

There is not much we can do now but to wait, and watch.  Jin'do is weak, and prime for striking, but I must wait for word from Rastakhan before issuing orders.  Until then, you and your raptor will have to wait.

ua:
&lt;Ти пояснюєш Ґаліри все, що сталося досі.&gt;

Схоже, Джін'до вижив і збирає своїх братів, щоб знову призвати Хаккара в цей світ. Добре, що ти $p(прийшов:прийшла) поговорити зі мною.

Зараз ми мало що можемо вдіяти, крім як чекати й спостерігати. Джін'до слабкий і зручна ціль для удару, але я мушу дочекатися звістки від Растахана, перш ніж віддавати накази. До того часу тобі й твоєму ящеру доведеться зачекати.

en:
The arakkoa seek to bring Terokk back beyond the veil of time and Rilak... wants to find a way to accelerate the process?  Is he out of his mind?

&lt;Adaris lies back down as his strength fades.&gt;

You've done your duty, &lt;name&gt;.  It is time you let my men take over from here.  This has become a purely military matter.

&lt;Lady Jaina listens intently as you report the results of your aerial survey.&gt;

A rune circle, dragonkin? The Defias have allied themselves with HER? The traitor?

&lt;Lady Jaina composes herself and prepares to explain.&gt;

ua:
&lt;Леді Джайна уважно слухає, поки ти звітуєш про результати повітряної розвідки.&gt;

Рунічне коло? Драконіди? Дефіаси об'єдналися з НЕЮ? Із зрадницею?

&lt;Леді Джайна опановує себе й готується пояснити.&gt;

en:
&lt;Alaenra looks at your very sticky fingers.&gt;

Well done! I... shan't shake your hand though. Just well done.

Unfortunately, the bees are still very upset. Still, we might find a use for the honey later?

&lt;Thalyssra clutches the spellstone tightly for a moment.&gt;

He brought this upon himself.

I cannot linger in the past. Elisande is weaker without him, and we are one step closer to righting the wrongs inflicted upon the shal'dorei.

ua:
&lt;Талісра на мить міцно стискає камінь чар.&gt;

Він сам це на себе накликав.

Я не можу застрягати в минулому. Без нього Елісанда стала слабшою, і ми на крок ближче до того, щоб виправити кривди, завдані шал'дорай.

en:
Collect 8 Ethereal Bead Strands in the Crypt of the Lost Mason.
8Ethereal Bead Strand (8)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(277955, 0, 8, null, null));

ua:
Збери 8 ниток ефірних намистин у Склепі Загубленого Муляра.
8Нитка ефірних намистин (8)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(277955, 0, 8, null, null));

en:
&lt;Kelsey takes the journal and gingerly flips through it.&gt;

I'm trying not to laugh. This is classic. They have no idea they're even on Kalimdor!

These later pages though...something more significant may be occuring here.

&lt;Minx takes the letter from you and begins to read it.&gt;

Uh oh...

&lt;Minx smells the parchment.&gt;

Disgusting!

&lt;Minx folds the paper in half and looks at you.&gt;

The good news is that this isn't toilet paper. The bad news is that the ink on this paper is a mixture of kodo poop and blood. That's not the worst of it, though...

I see... yes, we can work with this.

&lt;Lynnore looks at the night elf's head.&gt;

Loramus Thalipedes, demon hunter.  I look forward to meeting you.

Curious. Even as fragments, the pieces hum with energy. I wonder if I...

&lt;Angorla presses the fragments together like a puzzle, squeezing them in her palm. After a moment, she opens her hand and reveals a neatly-fused shard.&gt;

It may be less intricately-carved or ornate as the citrine you found in the vault, but there is power here, even in a small stone like this.

&lt;Ornak allows the muck to drip from his fingertips.&gt;

Now that's the stuff! I'll start mixing and diluting this with gravel and water. Just a few handfuls of this can enhance enough cement for an entire stone tower.

We've got big plans for this port, &lt;name&gt;. You'll see!

ua:
&lt;Орнак дає багнюці стекти з кінчиків пальців.&gt;

Ось це саме те! Зараз я почну змішувати й розводити це з гравієм і водою. Кілька жмень цього можуть посилити цемент для цілої кам'яної вежі.

У нас великі плани щодо цього порту, {name}. Ось побачиш!

en:
Lovely! Just lovely!

&lt;Laurith applies a sprinkling of pollen to one of the bloodspore carpels and then utters an incantation.&gt;

Hrmph... I don't understand. Unless... Why of course!

&lt;The priest quietly mouths a benediction for you.&gt;

Bless you, &lt;name&gt;, you have answered my prayers. Stand proudly in the Light, chin held high with the knowledge that your actions were most holy!

I'm certain that the church's coffers can yield up something of use to you.

&lt;Mowi takes a look at the plans that you hand to her.&gt;

But... but, this is just gibberish!

What does this even say? What language is that?

ua:
&lt;Мові дивиться на плани, що ти їй $p(передав:передала).&gt;

Але... але це просто якась абракадабра!

Про що тут узагалі йдеться? Що це за мова?

en:
Collect 6 Nutrient-Rich Soil in Harandar.
6Nutrient-Rich Soil (6)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(246926, 0, 6, null, null));

