en:
Collect 3 Mask Fragments within The Venomous Abyss on Heroic difficulty.
3Mask Fragment (3)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(280089, 0, 3, null, null));

Yes? My father...

&lt;Her eyes become downcast.&gt;

I wish... there was something I could have done for him... If only I had talked to him before he...

ua:
Так? Мій батько...

&lt;Вона опускає очі.&gt;

Шкода... що я нічого не могла для нього зробити... Якби ж я поговорила з ним, перш ніж він...

en:
&lt;A warbling cry emanates from the fish. It casts its song into the ocean depths.&gt;

I expected an ignoble end at the hands of the kobyss for my folly. Never could I have believed a land-dweller would be my savior. I will remember you. Now, let the facade be at its end. My kind will be expecting me.

&lt;The fish's form begins to shift and unwind. You realize its guise as a fish has been yet another illusion.&gt;

&lt;As you peer at the shrine in front of you, you can't help but revel at the construction of it.

Seamlessly constructed with azure jewels placed just so in a radial pattern, collapsing towards a single point.

A single, empty point.&gt;

Collect 30 Murloc-Skewered Lynxfish or give King Mrgl-Mrgl 30 Lynxfish.
30Murloc-Skewered Lynxfish (30)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(263202, 0, 30, null, null));

