en:
Whoah, whoah, WHOAH! You brought back BLOOD? I guess I should have looked around for a half second before I asked you to bring me something red.

Yeesh!

&lt;Li Li turns back to the ingredients, spends a moment crushing the flower petals, and then mixes in some of the blood.&gt;

&lt;She begins to giggle.&gt;

Remove 8 Nalorakk Trinkets from the furbolgs in Spiritpaw Village.
8Nalorakk Trinket (8)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(248300, 0, 8, null, null));

ua:
Забери 8 талісманів Налорака у фурболґів у Селищі Духолапів.
8Талісман Налорака (8)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(248300, 0, 8, null, null));

en:
Oh! This is it! It's the big one!

&lt;Fizzlefuse calls out to his workers.&gt;

We're in business boys!

To fight so many, in so short a time, is truly a feat of stamina.

I am tired just looking at you.

&lt;Pelagos laughs.&gt;

That should make them think twice about making more of those things. I shudder to think what it would be like to have to fight an army of those things.

&lt;The element-tamer is thoughtful for a moment.&gt;

I guess it would be just like fighting the endless waves of the Scourge.

&lt;Zenda spits on the hozen totem.&gt;

Do not be fooled by deir appearance. Dese hozen are ruthless. Some chased my brother out of his own bar in Zuldazar and took it over as deir own!

I have seen dese winged ones, and dey are unwelcome wherever dey go.

Collect 50 Void-Tainted Remains.
50Void-Tainted Remains (50)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(245937, 0, 50, null, null));

ua:
Збери 50 Останків, оскверненних Порожнечею.
50 Останків, оскверненних Порожнечею (50)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(245937, 0, 50, null, null));

en:
What... WHAT!?

Bael'dun in ruins? Corpses everywhere - no. No!

&lt;You describe the evidence you found at the scene.&gt;

The Bilgewater goblins, was it? They want a fight do they? We'll show 'em what it means to be a part of the Horde, we will. I'll fill the Battlescar with their corpses. I'll redden the dirt with their blood.

&lt;Twinbraid grabs you by the collar.&gt;

Goblins. Are going. To die!

Collect 8 Venomous Horns from Horned Frogs.
8Venomous Horn (8)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(246621, 0, 8, null, null));

ua:
Збери 8 отруйних рогів із рогатих жаб.
8Отруйний ріг (8)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(246621, 0, 8, null, null));

en:
It is embarrassing to have been kidnapped by Arnak again. I heard the fighting outside. Did you kill him?

&lt;The shaman looks sad for just a moment.&gt;

I am happy to be free once more. Now, how can I help you, &lt;race&gt;?

&lt;Tooranu looks over the documents you discovered.&gt;

It's all here, &lt;name&gt;. Details of how the cult is tearing up the Highlands, who they've sent, where they are, and what they plan to do. Invaluable.

I shall distribute this knowledge to the rest of the Earthen Ring at once. Thank you, friend.

&lt;Scout Vor'takh smiles.&gt;

Thor Modan is on the verge of collapse, then?

Very well. We will soon turn our attention to Dun Argol.

Hmph. I suppose if you're assisting me with my task, I should learn your name.

&lt;Thaedris reaches into the book and pulls out an unfamiliar, dried plant.&gt;

Thank you for fetching me another one of the ingredients. Your assistance is... welcome, &lt;name&gt;.

ua:
Гм. Гадаю, якщо ти допомагаєш мені з моєю справою, варто дізнатися твоє ім'я.

&lt;Таедріс сягає рукою в книгу й дістає незнайому висушену рослину.&gt;

Дякую, що приніс мені ще один із потрібних інгредієнтів. Твоя допомога... не зайва, {name}.

en:
That is... 

&lt;Keyrra carefully places the bracelet in her palm.&gt;

I can't believe it.

Gather 3 Sunsilk.
3Sunsilk (3)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(249422, 0, 3, null, null));

ua:
Збери 3 одиниці сонячного шовку.
3Сонячний шовк (3)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(249422, 0, 3, null, null));

en:
That you should join us now, on the precipice of this treachery, is curious.

&lt;The Paragon of Purity studies you with a piercing gaze.&gt;

You have done well. The Archon will know of your contributions this day.

You saved my friends!

&lt;Primrose gives you a small grin.&gt;

We... we make a pretty good team, huh?

Recover 35 trophies from gnarldin and their allies.
35Gnarldin Trophies (35)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(256672, 0, 35, null, null));

ua:
Здобудь 35 трофеїв у гнарлдінів та їхніх союзників.
35Трофеї гнарлдінів (35)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(256672, 0, 35, null, null));

en:
Collect 40 Totem Remnants.
40Totem Remnant (40)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(254430, 0, 40, null, null));

ua:
Збери 40 залишків тотема.
40Залишок тотема (40)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(254430, 0, 40, null, null));

en:
Well, lookee there! Ye've got yerself a right bushel o' wolpertingers, ye do!

&lt;He takes a deep drink from his tankard.&gt;

I'll tell ye what I'm gonna do. Since ye're such a spot-on hunter, I'll let ye keep one'a these fer yer very own!

&lt;Gazrog opens the lockbox and begins counting up the silver while you relate your story.&gt;

What!? Raptors? Just the raptors? Assaulting our caravans and looting them? Perhaps they are as intelligent as the rumors say. As if we didn't have enough problems, now we've got to deal with brainy lizards with a lust for coin.

Here, &lt;name&gt; - you've earned a share of the rescued silver. Thank you.

ua:
&lt;Газрог відчиняє скриню й починає рахувати срібло, поки ти розповідаєш свою історію.&gt;

Що?! Раптори? Самі лише раптори? Нападають на наші каравани й грабують їх? Мабуть, вони таки такі розумні, як подейкують. Наче нам мало клопотів, тепер ще мороки з тямущими ящерами, що жадають монет.

Ось, &lt;name&gt; — ти заслужи$p(в:ла) частку врятованого срібла. Дякую.

en:
&lt;Doctor Malefious looks through the contents of the package.&gt;

Glorious! Exactly to specifications!

Here is your payment, &lt;name&gt;. Keep what you've seen and done to yourself. This work is all classified - information is given out on a need to know basis.

Welcome to Cenarion Hold.

&lt;Windcaller Proudhorn brushes some snow off of your shoulder.&gt;

You've certainly come from far off.

&lt;Tabetha smiles slightly.&gt;

Krog wishes me to scry for the Grimtotems, eh? Well, I have no need of magic in this case.

It seems we have a mutual enemy. The Grimtotems have built an outpost nearby and are a constant thorn in the side of me and my students.

ua:
&lt;Табета ледь усміхається.&gt;

Крог хоче, щоб я поворожила на гримтотемів, еге ж? Що ж, магія мені тут не потрібна.

Виходить, у нас спільний ворог. Гримтотеми збудували неподалік форпост і є постійною скалкою для мене та моїх учнів.

en:
Sooo coooool!

&lt;Maru and Enzo exchange looks, eyebrow wiggles, and nods.&gt;

We fink you should hold onto the tweasure-finding stick. You're a real good sleuf and maybe you can find more tweasures for us!

Damn shame... He was a good goblin.

&lt;Saurboz shakes his fist.&gt;

As for you, &lt;name&gt;, you've done well. These attack plans will help us prepare. I want you to deliver the plans to Overlord Krom'gar personally! There's sure to be a promotion in it for you.

Bring the Hastily Written Note to Namaji at Amani'Zar Village.
Hastily Written Note (1)
Familiar Amani Headdress (1)
Hastily Written Note (1)
Hastily Written Note (1)
Familiar Threshadon Tooth Necklace (1)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(268968, 0, 1, null, null));
WH.ge('icon-list-icon2').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(268964, 0, 1, null, null));
WH.ge('icon-list-icon3').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(268952, 0, 1, null, null));
WH.ge('icon-list-icon4').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(268929, 0, 1, null, null));
WH.ge('icon-list-icon5').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(268965, 0, 1, null, null));

&lt;Zorek flips through the manual.&gt;

Hrm, interesting...

According to the manual, the vrykul have a special tool that allows them to control the harpoon guns with deadly accuracy. It looks a bit like the wheel of one of our ships. Furthermore, it's portable and seems to plug into the harpoon guns like a key. We need to get our hands on one of those!

I am indeed familiar with items such as this.

&lt;Stefan looks you in the eye.&gt;

It would seem, &lt;name&gt;, that you have been... chosen.

Teamwork makes the dream work, or so they say. It would appear that the rhyme carries truth to it. Hmmm.

&lt;Eternus pauses for a moment in thought.&gt;

I wonder what other rhymes carry such power. That bears some future experimentation.

Salvage 8 crab trap pieces in the Serpent's Tail.
8Crab Trap Pieces (8)
8Undamaged Trap Needle (8)
8Untouched Crab Lure (8)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(277992, 0, 8, null, null));
WH.ge('icon-list-icon2').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(274579, 0, 8, null, null));
WH.ge('icon-list-icon3').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(277848, 0, 8, null, null));

