WH.ge('icon-list-icon3').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(277848, 0, 8, null, null));

en:
&lt;K. Lee looks at the engine part and then stares off into the distance for a moment.&gt;

This is somethin' real special.  Difficulty to say where it's from--like it just fell out of the sky.  I'm gonna hold on to this and pay you for your troubles.

Between you and me though, I think it's best if we didn't mention this to anyone.

&lt;K. Lee puts on her most charming smile.&gt;

Collect 10 Corrupted Bones from Lightbloom-Infested wildlife.
10Lightbleached Rootbone (10)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(238196, 0, 10, null, null));

ua:
Збери 10 зіпсованих кісток із тварин, заражених Світлоцвітом.
10 вибілених Світлом кореневих кісток (10)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(238196, 0, 10, null, null));

en:
&lt;Rokag takes the plans from you and looks them over.&gt;

So Kaide was right! Those fel orc scum are up to something. I never would've guessed they were colluding with the blood elves, though.

According to this map, the fel orcs are to keep us busy... but why? This is disturbing news, &lt;name&gt;. You were correct in bringing it to me right away.

ua:
&lt;Рокаг бере в тебе плани й переглядає їх.&gt;

Тож слова Кайде підтвердилися! Ці покидьки з орків Скверни щось замислили. Але я б ніколи не подумав, що вони змовляються з кривавими ельфами.

За цією мапою орки Скверни мають зайняти нас... але навіщо? Це тривожна новина, &lt;name&gt;. Ти правильно вчин$p(ив:ила), одразу принісши її мені.

en:
&lt;Archaeologist Groff picks through the wreckage.&gt;

Well, not much here that don't look stepped on, sat on, or soaked in a toilet. But toss some thatch on top and it'll do.

Tell me, &lt;name&gt;, do you consider yourself an architect?

Our bones are all we have left of an existence we left behind a long time ago.

&lt;The prince stares intently into your eyes.&gt;

Stay with me, &lt;class&gt;. I will help you find your Tidestone.

ua:
Наші кістки — це все, що лишилося від існування, яке ми давно залишили позаду.

&lt;Принц пильно вдивляється тобі в очі.&gt;

Залишся зі мною, {class}. Я допоможу тобі знайти твій Приливний камінь.

en:
These daggers, look!

&lt;Lya holds the blades hilt-to-hilt.&gt;

They were built to fit together! But how to join them...?

Collect 15 Void Essence from monsters around Voidstorm.
15Void Essence (15)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(248086, 0, 15, null, null));

ua:
Збери 15 одиниць Есенції Порожнечі з монстрів навколо Тінебурі.
15 Есенції Порожнечі (15)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(248086, 0, 15, null, null));

en:
You didn't... KILL the machines to get these, right?.

&lt;Lunk looks upset.&gt;

Right?

I hope these weren't too heavy for a small brul such as yourself to carry.

But these will be more than enough to show you a suitable design.

&lt;Jabrul begins to carve one of the jewels into a design, instructing you how it's done as he works.&gt;

ua:
Сподіваюся, вони не були надто важкими, щоб нести їх такому малому, як ти.

Але цього більш ніж достатньо, щоб показати тобі гідний ескіз.

&lt;Джабрул починає гранити один із самоцвітів, пояснюючи тобі кожен крок роботи.&gt;

en:
&lt;Ravandwyr carefully examines the crystals, then selects one.&gt;

This crystal should work. I'll reshape the stave's socket to secure the new headpiece.

When Archmage Vargoth sees it, he will be disappointed, but I can bear my master's disappointment if it means we've freed him.

She can't keep running off like this! The rest of us followed her here--against our better judgement I might add--but we never agreed to...

&lt;Hannan sighs.&gt;

No, we knew exactly what we were getting into with her. And the... consequences.

&lt;Handing over the box, you tell the caregive that Nurguni is making arrangements to have the larger items delivered by wagon.&gt;

Splendid! Now, I'll finally be able to set up some beds and a first aid station so that we can better treat the wounded and any survivors we encounter.

I can't thank you enough for your help, &lt;name&gt;. You have my thanks and that of the Azure Watch's vindicators.

