Perfectly handled. You could easily be a Deathstalker. And what could they have even done to you? You acted in self defense!

Now to deal with the final finger.

&lt;Kurekk gazes at the orb.&gt;

Is that... what I think it is?

We must get this to the Talon Altar.

&lt;Ruada nods solemnly.&gt;

Then it is done.

You are ready for your next lesson, &lt;name&gt;, but I will not be the one to teach it to you.

