en:
Phew!

&lt;Nikki wipes her brow with a sense of relief.&gt;

Whatever we offered him, I'm glad he was agreeable. I can tell you if he wasn't happy, I'd be on the first flight off this rock for sure.

ua:
Ху!

&lt;Ніккі з полегшенням витирає лоба.&gt;

Не знаю, що ми йому запропонували, але рада, що він погодився. Кажу тобі, якби він був незадоволений, я б точно чкурнула звідси першим же рейсом.

en:
&lt;Chieftain Ashtotem breathes a sigh of relief.&gt;

That should take some of the pressure off.

&lt;name&gt;, time and again you have proven your value to the taunka of Camp Winterhoof. Please, choose something from our bounty. I insist.

Outstanding! And it's in such good condition, too! Now let's see if there's anything in here that could be of help for you.

&lt;Several moments pass as Declan mutters to himself excitedly&gt;

Ah ha! Here ya go! The seed pods open when the plant is disturbed, but if the first cut is at the base, that drains a reservoir of water that is used to open and close the pods.  So, start at the bottom, working your way up, and you should get a better harvest.

Collect 8 Phytogenic Poison Parts.
