en:
&lt;Nokoma listens to your report from the test.&gt;

I'm relieved that the horn worked so well... maybe too well if what you're saying was true. You're sure the beast spoke? I don't know if I can go on with the hunt if that's true. I'll have to speak with Chief Ashtotem about it.

This horn may end up being merely decorative, but that won't diminish its worth. Thank you for all your help, &lt;name&gt;.

&lt;Myzrael speaks through the stone.&gt;

You have done it!  You opened the Stones of Binding!  I can feel the shackles about me loosen, and freedom draws ever closer.

You are a noble &lt;class&gt;, &lt;name&gt;.  My rescuer!

You saved my Speedbarge!

&lt;Razzeric embraces you in a manly hug!&gt;

I can't begin to tell you how relieved I am, Captain &lt;name&gt;!

A-ha! Soul Remnants!

&lt;Khadgar cradles the Remnants briefly and focuses intently upon them.&gt;

There, now you and your companions may access the upper level of the Citadel directly.

A remarkable find!

&lt;The professor browses the book's contents.&gt;

Some of these are hard to read, but if even a third of the contents of this journal are true, this is a real treasure. Would you trade it for a generous number of Darkmoon tickets?

Collect 100 Otherworldly Sparks of War in Naigtal, while in War Mode.
100Otherworldly Spark of War (100)



