en:
&lt;Alynblaze takes the vellums from you and applies them to his gear.&gt;

Yes! I feel like I can take on the entire Legion now!

Well, that may be a bit of an exaggeration, but I certainly feel up for some battle.

&lt;Harbinger Mikolaas accepts the last crystal from you.&gt;

That rounds out the set. All that remains to be done is to box them and send them to the Exodar.

&lt;The harbinger seems glad to be done with the task.&gt;

Don't get me wrong, &lt;name&gt;, I'm sure the research is valuable, but we're faced with a number of other pressing problems out here.

I wouldn't take what Arev'naal said to heart. The inquisitor demons are masters of misinformation. You don't suspect betrayal within the ranks, do you?

&lt;The Souleater looks thoughtful and grim.&gt;

I fear we won't have all of our answers about Lord Illidan for a while.

ua:
Я б не брала близько до серця те, що сказав Арев'наал. Демони-інквізитори — майстри дезінформації. Ти ж не підозрюєш зраду в наших лавах?

&lt;Поглиначка душ виглядає замисленою й похмурою.&gt;

Боюся, ще якийсь час у нас не буде всіх відповідей щодо володаря Іллідана.

