I know that look. I, too, gazed into the crucible and saw the horrors of the tomb.

We must act quickly.

ua:
&lt;Кейн зітхає.&gt;

Я знаю цей погляд. Я теж дивився в горнило й бачив жахіття гробниці.

Треба діяти швидко.

en:
&lt;Theldren nods coldly at your offering.&gt;

Excellent work, &lt;name&gt;.

All who enter shall see these fangs upon our shelf and fear the wrath brought upon those who would stand against the dragon flights.

Ahh, it's nice to stretch out again. I've missed this place, you know.

&lt;Marasmius pauses for a moment.&gt;

Don't tell anyone here I said that, all right?

What a mean little creature!  I'm sure the Rokk will make something tasty with him.

I'm just kidding, of course.

&lt;Old Man Barlo winks slyly.&gt;

ua:
Яка ж вредна істота! Певен, Рокк приготує з нього щось смачненьке.

Звісно, я жартую.

&lt;Старий Барло хитро підморгує.&gt;

en:
What have you brought today, Archdruid?

&lt;Celadine examines the ancient tome.&gt;

This book... it changes everything!

ua:
Що ти $p(приніс:принесла) сьогодні, Архідруїде?

&lt;Селадина оглядає прадавній фоліант.&gt;

Ця книга... вона все змінює!

en:
&lt;Harbinger Mikolaas examines the crystal shard.&gt;

This shard is much different from the initial sample.

&lt;Harbinger Mikolaas holds the crystal up to catch the light.&gt;

Do you see how it pulsates like that? That's worrisome. I'll make a note in my report of the alterations the blood elves appear to have made to this crystal. Thank you again for your help, &lt;name&gt;.

&lt;Debaar listens as you describe the failure of the disguise.&gt;

What do you mean, our plan didn't work as intended?

Well, you did manage to get the kill, to your credit. Look at the size of this jaw! Hemet will be proud of our efforts. This crocolisk was truly a monster.

&lt;Orako is busy playing with Wolf.&gt;

Oh, thank you, &lt;name&gt;!  I knew Wolf was alive!

Here, take one of these.  I don't need them anymore.

Recover 6 Haranir Artifacts in the Blinding Bloom.
6Haranir Artifacts (6)



