en:
What is this? You... rescuing me?

&lt;Erunak smiles at you.&gt;

This will take some getting used to.

&lt;Pyxni examines the saberon claws.&gt;

We're gonna make a killing selling these as good luck charms to all the wannabe gladiators here at the arena!

From now on, the saberon will think twice about messing with the Steamwheedle Cartel!

&lt;The quartermaster gasps, but then his eyes narrow as he studies you for a moment.&gt;

I trust that you didn't stash any of this on the side for yourself? You wouldn't be that selfish when the fate of Venomspite is at stake?

Besides, I'm going to reward you with a percentage of the take. It's not much, but in times like this, we all have to make sacrifices.

8Verdant Stalker Sludge (8)
 Roots tended (1)



