en:
It's decided, then. The assassination of Blood Prince Dreven at sea will be unexpected, demoralizing, and beneficial to the long-term success of our larger campaign.

&lt;Halford Wyrmbane smiles.&gt;

Everything I'm looking for in a strategy.

These look pretty good. Ared would have loved to get his hands on these.

&lt;Miall wipes away a tear.&gt;

 I'm sorry, this is making me too emotional, these will do just fine.

Just in time! All done... look!

&lt;Ken-Ken holds up a carved wooden mask with a ridiculous face.&gt;

Now we put on finishing touches and we gots a guaranteed FUN MACHINE!

What you see here is all that remains of the taunka from the Borean Tundra and the Dragonblight. They are a broken people... battered and brought to the brink of extinction by the Scourge.

&lt;Brighthoof shakes her head.&gt;

Only the Horde can save them now. Only the Horde can mend their broken spirits. We will nurse them back to full health and they will in turn strengthen the Horde in Northrend.

I have never felt power like this before...

&lt;Y'mera handles the shard cautiously.&gt;

We should get this to Velen as soon as we can.

What have you brought today, Highlord?

&lt;Elda examines the ancient tome.&gt;

This book... it changes everything!

ua:
Що ти $p(приніс:принесла) сьогодні, Верховний Володарю?

&lt;Ельда оглядає прадавній фоліант.&gt;

Ця книга... вона все змінює!

en:
&lt;Brunn's face reddens until its color is indistinguishable from his beard.&gt;

He wants to do WHAT to my gryphons?

If that little pipsqueak puts anything other than a saddle on them, I'll personally travel up to Blade's Edge and stuff that rocket o' his down his throat!

&lt;Didi takes the pylons and begins tinkering with them and starts writing some notes.&gt;

Yea, that should do the trick!

One new and improved Reaves module schematic for you, &lt;name&gt;.

ua:
&lt;Діді бере пілони й починає з ними поратися, попутно роблячи якісь нотатки.&gt;

Так, це має спрацювати!

Ось тобі нова, вдосконалена схема модуля для Рівза, {name}.

