en:
&lt;Krog listens to your report.&gt;

I'm impressed, &lt;name&gt;. I would've thought that the Grimtotem criminals would've been more difficult to locate. The Alliance are truly incompetent.

In truth, I just sought to answer the death of one of my men, but this situation has been more fortunate than expected. If the Grimtotem choose to retaliate, it will likely be against the Alliance. Perhaps we will soon have the manpower to drive the scum from these shores once and for all.

&lt;Biru rambles almost incoherently, explaining the mechanics of mining storm silver from a seam&gt;

... and dat is how you... get de most of mining... Zzz...

&lt;As Biru drifts to sleep amidst a pungent cloud of brandy vapors, you think of the advice he provided.

Eager to experiment with your new mining technique, you leave the sleeping troll laying where he is.&gt;

Collect 8 K'areshi Keepsakes found at the Ethereum Overcroft.
