en:
Well done!

&lt;The smith examines the blade closely.&gt;

I'd say it's a fair improvement over the crude Legion weapons you started with. Not only will this blade cut down Illidari demons, but it will work against the Legion's minions as well.

Oh, back already? That seemed quick. How'd it go?

&lt;You recount your finding of the shrine and the replacement of the gems.&gt;

That does sound like quite the adventure! Excellent work, &lt;name&gt;.

ua:
О, вже поверну$p(вся:лася)? Швидко ти. Як усе пройшло?

&lt;Ти розповідаєш про те, як знайш$p(ов:ла) святилище й замін$p(ив:ила) самоцвіти.&gt;

От це пригода! Чудова робота, {name}.

en:
You've found one of our scouting reports? It was overdue, and I feared it had been intercepted by the enemy.

&lt;The captain looks over the letter.&gt;

Yes, this is what I've been expecting. The Legion is planning something and this is the breakthrough we've been looking for!

ua:
Ти $p(знайшов:знайшла) один з наших розвідувальних звітів? Він мав прийти раніше, і я вже почала боятися, що його перехопив ворог.

&lt;Капітан переглядає лист.&gt;

Так, це саме те, чого я й очікувала. Легіон щось замислив, і це саме той прорив, якого ми шукали!

en:
You've gathered enough here to last me for many moons.

&lt;Hrul begins to work with the claws. It's clear that he's using very little of each, but still able to make an excellent armor piece.&gt;

I hope you were able to learn something from this, &lt;name&gt;.

ua:
Ти $p(зібрав:зібрала) достатньо, щоб мені вистачило на багато місяців.

&lt;Грул береться до роботи з кігтями. Видно, що він використовує лише малу частку кожного, але все одно виходить чудова деталь обладунку.&gt;

Сподіваюся, ти $p(зміг:змогла) чогось навчитися з цього, {name}.

en:
&lt;Your trainer examines the stems, fingering the individual bite marks.&gt;

If you'll pardon my language, they really gnawed the crap out of these things.

Look more closely, though. You can see that they focused on extracting the energy from the stem's central filament...

&lt;The noble lady grins wickedly.&gt;

That's quite a gruesome trophy collection you have there. I would have believed you if you had simply said they were dead, though I do appreciate the extra effort. Thank you for having the foresight to take care of them.

The Twilight Gate will soon be ours. Time to move up to the Twilight Citadel.

&lt;The arakkoa merchant looks you up and down.&gt;

Well-equipped, aren't we? Azik is betting you are someone of importance to your people.

Come closer, friend. Speak with me for just a moment.

Ears of the Burning Blade?

&lt;Sorrem smiles.&gt;

Well done, &lt;class&gt;. This is just a shadow of what will soon become of that vile cult!

A what symbol!? That can't be right...

&lt;Thaelin scratches his beard.&gt;

There's only one way to find out.

Oh, wow! These are worth a fortune.

&lt;Slinky eyes everything with a practiced, greed-filled eye.&gt;

I just hope that the Trade Prince doesn't notice them when you hand them over with the rest of your wealth....

&lt;The foreman speaks in hushed tones.&gt;

You came in here to kill me?  Hmph.  Well I guess the ethereal don't know everything, do they?

I'm not the one that you want, trust me.

Bael'dun? Destroyed?

&lt;Wincing in pain, Gann twists his head to peer behind him, where plumes of smoke darken the skyline.&gt;

&lt;name&gt;, my friend. You have avenged Taurajo and avenged the Tauren people. The invaders will not soon recover from that blow. Thank you.

&lt;Drom coughs up a bit of blood.&gt;

Norgannon's Core, eh? I've spent a fair number of days trying to find anything I could about it myself, but it seems to be one of the relics that's still guarded. With reason I suppose.

If King Stormheart sent you, he surely must see something noble in ye... and I'm not one to refuse my king.

&lt;Li Li beams, unable to contain her excitement.&gt; 

Lorewalker Cho is here! So is Yu'lon!

So this means that Shen-zi Su actually returned to the waters of Pandaria? I can't believe it!

A bazillion macaroons?!?! Where are we going to get that kind of moolah?

&lt;Sassy thinks a moment.&gt;

Um... did the Trade Prince say anything about letting me escape with you on his yacht?

Discover 5 sources of fel magic near the Royal Exchange.
 Sources of fel magic discovered (5)
Stained Worker's Shirt (1)
Bottled Fel Dust (1)
Blackened Metal Fragment (1)
Handwritten List (1)
Drained Wyrm Core (1)



