en:
&lt;You begin to remove all the cracked gems from the shrine and carefully start placing the new ones in.

Placing the final one, a pulse radiates from the shrine, as the light in the area seems to draw into it.

That strange, similar glow now emanating from the shrine leads you to believe it is once again active.&gt;

&lt;Malister beckons you closer and speaks in whispered tones.&gt;

I was worried that something like this might happen. I tried to dissuade the captain from this course of action, but he is a dwarf of action with a definite outlook on how things should proceed.

Let us speak of the options left to us.

So it was the Defias who served as the hands of Onyxia in this plot?

&lt;The admirall's face grows red with anger and her hands clench into fists.&gt;

You and Lady Jaina have done Stormwind a great service this day. The traitors will not live long enough to regret their crimes.

ua:
Отже, це Дефаяс слугували руками Оніксії в цій змові?

&lt;Обличчя адміралки червоніє від гніву, а її руки стискаються в кулаки.&gt;

Ви з леді Джайною сьогодні зробили Штормовію велику послугу. Зрадники не проживуть достатньо довго, щоб пошкодувати про свої злочини.

