en:
&lt;Kuhuine sniffs the small gland.&gt;

That's certainly a scent gland, alright. It seems to be mostly inert from an alchemical point of view... but I'd guess that this is what is attracting those foxes.

Express this gland when you can, and you may find yourself attracting a friend or two.

&lt;Vindicator Nobundo listens closely as you speak of your vision.&gt;

These are grave images of which you speak, &lt;name&gt;! If Cho'gall continues bleeding the naaru of its Light, K'ure will die and in the naaru's place a void god will emerge. Void gods are terrible creatures that live only to destroy!

We must travel to Oshu'gun immediately and put a stop to the threat of Cho'gall!

ua:
&lt;Поборник Нобундо уважно слухає, поки ти розповідаєш про своє видіння.&gt;

То жахливі образи, про які ти говориш, &lt;name&gt;! Якщо Чо'ґалл і далі висмоктуватиме Світло з наару, К'юре помре, а на місці наару постане бог Порожнечі. Боги Порожнечі — жахливі істоти, що живуть лише заради руйнування!

Ми мусимо негайно вирушити до Ошу'гуна й зупинити загрозу від Чо'ґалла!

en:
&lt;Upon hearing the news, Bloodhilt snorts. His eyes gleam. He tips his head back and bellows a wet, cackling laugher that echoes between the blackened walls of Desolation hold and reverberates throughout the hills beyond.&gt;

So it is done! The Butcher of Taurajo is felled at last. Cut down in the streets like a dog. Fitting.

You have done well, &lt;name&gt;. You've sowed fear into our enemies, and soon we will reap the harvest!

&lt;Lilian quickly looks over the documents and nods.&gt;

I suppose that someone in the Horde will find this information useful.

Probably goblins.

The loss of life...it pains me.

&lt;Watcher Jhang sighs.&gt;

Thank you, &lt;name&gt;. When we are all reunited, the naga won't stand a chance.

You are the help that we requested?

&lt;Althea sighs.&gt;

I suppose you will have to do.

What have you brought today, Grandmaster?

&lt;Cho examines the ancient tome.&gt;

This book... it changes everything!

ua:
Що ти $p(приніс:принесла) сьогодні, Грандмайстре?

&lt;Хранитель історії Чо оглядає прадавній фоліант.&gt;

Ця книга... вона все змінює!

en:
&lt;Calder holds the brains in an outstretched hand while withdrawing a gore-caked multi-tool from his belt.&gt;

Wonderful work! Now the secret here is to leave the reptilian nervous systems intact while removing the higher cognitive functions. We can't have our new friend developing a conscience or remembering he's Alliance...

&lt;Calder digs and snips at the brain, removing large chunks.&gt;

And... we're finished! How lovely.

ua:
&lt;Колдер тримає мізки на простягнутій долоні, а іншою рукою дістає з-за пояса заляпаний кров'ю мультиінструмент.&gt;

Чудова робота! Секрет у тому, щоб залишити нервову систему рептилії неушкодженою, але прибрати вищі когнітивні функції. Нам ні до чого, щоб наш новий друг обзавівся совістю чи згадав, що він з Альянсу...

&lt;Колдер риється в мозку й відрізає великі шматки.&gt;

І... готово! Просто чудово.

en:
It's not enough!

&lt;The sergeant's voice cracks as he mourns the corruption of his fallen comrades.&gt;

We must do more to show respect for the memories of those men!

&lt;You hear a voice in your head. It is Khu'nok.&gt;

Your name has been heard in the whistling winds, &lt;name&gt;. You have done a great thing for my kin. For this we will consider you an ally. Alas, our torment cannot end without bloodshed and violence.

The price of peace for the mammoths will be the death of Kaw...

&lt;Ulfang howls loudly at your defeat of his great eagle enemy.&gt;

The honor of the kill is yours. I wish that it had been my maw to finally close upon her neck.

Let us not waste the sacrifice that she has made for us. Here, eat them!

&lt;The snapdragon perks up as you approach and sniffs the air as if to check to see if you've brought it food. 

The second it sees the rations in your hand it begins snapping it's jaws in anticipation of a tasty meal. 

With a newly full belly the snapdragon runt lays down to rest but peers up at you, as if hoping you will return tomorrow.&gt;

Is that?

&lt;Jane takes the locket and opens it tenderly. Tears begin to well up in her eyes as she closes it and tucks it away in her jacket.&gt;

Thank you.

Collect 12 Naga Fangs from naga near the Sunset Strand.
12Naga Fang (12)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(249541, 0, 12, null, null));

ua:
Збери 12 ікол у наґ біля Берега Заходу Сонця.
12Ікло наґа (12)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(249541, 0, 12, null, null));

en:
Only one may enter? I know just the person for this mission.

&lt;Sylvanas nods at you.&gt;

I will prepare our forces and have them at the ready.

&lt;You explain to Surkhan what has happened up to this point.&gt;

It would seem that Jin'do has survived, and he is rallying his brothers to once again summon Hakkar into this world.  It was good of you to come to speak with me.

There is not much we can do now but to wait, and watch.  Jin'do is weak, and prime for striking, but I must wait for word from Rastakhan before issuing orders.  Until then, you and your raptor will have to wait.

&lt;The archmage is out of breath.&gt;

Give me - give me a moment. Pshew.

&lt;name&gt;, that was incredible! You are possibly the greatest &lt;class&gt; I've ever had the honor to fight alongside.

&lt;Archmage Vargoth's image examines you as you convey Ravandwyr's message.&gt;

Ravandwyr has everything a master can expect of his apprentice. When I gave him the staff and told him to flee, I hoped that he would use it to find help and free me once Kael'thas's forces withdrew from the tower. Since then, I have learned a great deal about the nature of the curse.

It can be broken, &lt;name&gt;, but it will require your help.

Have you done that before? Your skill with my machete seemed practiced.

&lt;The brave looks at you warily.&gt;

I'll take it back from you now, &lt;class&gt;.

&lt;Brother Nimetz opens up a pouch and lets you place the crystal inside.&gt;

I knew they'd have some more of this substance.  I'm going to send this to my contacts at Fort Livingston, to the south.  Hopefully they'll have some more luck with it.

Thank you for everything, &lt;name&gt;.

ua:
&lt;Брат Німец відкриває торбинку й дозволяє тобі покласти туди кристал.&gt;

Я знав, що в них знайдеться ще цієї речовини. Відправлю це моїм знайомим у Форт Лівінґстон, на південь. Сподіваюся, їм пощастить з цим більше.

Дякую тобі за все, {name}.

en:
Collect 5 doses of Virulent Ula'tek Venom from the Children of Ula'tek at the Serpent's Tail.
5Virulent Ula'tek Venom (5)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(274296, 0, 5, null, null));




Provided item: 

Dezi's Potion Bottle (1)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon2').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(274297, 0, 0, null, null));

ua:
Збери 5 доз Злоякісної отрути Ула'тека в Дітей Ула'тека біля Змієвого Хвоста.
5Злоякісна отрута Ула'тека (5)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(274296, 0, 5, null, null));




Наданий предмет: 

Пляшка для зілля Дезі (1)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon2').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(274297, 0, 0, null, null));

en:
&lt;Lieutenant Fairweather grins at the story that you tell her about your adventures at Boulder'mok.&gt;

Ah, I wish that I could have been there with you.  Let me tell you something, &lt;name&gt;: never accept any duty that keeps you from the glory of the battlefield!

Hah!  After all of the ogre killing that you've done, are there any still left in these mountains for me?!

&lt;The murloc spirit looks upon you sadly.&gt;

Salt-Flop did not shame himself by running away.  Look behind me, and see for yourself.

The Rockpool had no hope against the naga's attack.

What have you brought today, Battlelord?

&lt;Fjornson examines the ancient tome.&gt;

This book... it changes everything!

ua:
Що ти $p(приніс:принесла) сьогодні, Воєводо?

&lt;Фьорнсон оглядає прадавній фоліант.&gt;

Ця книга... вона все змінює!

en:
&lt;Gurtar listens as you inform him of Sheelah's passing.&gt;

I'll deliver this to Hellscream personally, &lt;race&gt;.

In the meantime, there's something I need you to do for me....

&lt;Tony unhinges one of the weapons and peers down the barrel.&gt;

Oooh, very nice. Shiny. Loud. Now we're talkin'.

Not much left to do but close the deal...

&lt;Naralex slowly takes the squirming heart from you, visibly disturbed.&gt;

I've been a fool. The one truth I did not want to accept has been staring me in the face this entire time...this foul thing is proof of that.

You and I have much work to do.

ua:
&lt;Наралекс повільно забирає в тебе серце, що звивається, вочевидь стривожений.&gt;

Я був дурнем. Єдина правда, яку я не хотів приймати, весь цей час стояла просто переді мною... і ця гидота — тому доказ.

Нам із тобою чекає чимало роботи.

en:
Yay! Oh. Y-you saw someone? My papa?

&lt;Lynn hugs her toy and sniffs&gt;

I haven't seen my Mama in awhile. I hope she's okay.

&lt;You offer a short introduction, explaining you were sent by Sergeant Nazgrim.&gt;

Ah, so you're something in the way of reinforcements, then. Good.

Tormak and his men have need of your blade.

Collect 20 femurs from Twilight's Blade cultists in Atal'Kaldan.
20Cultist Femur (20)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(246440, 0, 20, null, null));

ua:
Збери 20 стегнових кісток у культистів Клинка Сутінків в Атал'Калдані.
20Стегнова кістка культиста (20)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(246440, 0, 20, null, null));

en:
What's this then?

&lt;Alard takes the list and looks it over. His eyes widen as he reaches the bottom&gt;

I take it you don't fully grasp what it is that you need, do you? If this is truly what's required then we better get started.

Collect 6 Poisonous Frog Secretions from frogs near the Amani Pass.
6Poisonous Frog Secretions (6)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(249687, 0, 6, null, null));

ua:
Збери 6 отруйних виділень жаби у жаб біля Аманського перевалу.
6 Отруйних виділень жаби (6)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(249687, 0, 6, null, null));

en:
&lt;Nork scoffs.&gt;

Prisoners? These aren't prisoners. They're cowardly dogs! Just look at 'em. Did you know that without exception, every single one of these yellow-bellied "soldiers" came to our gates and surrendered their arms and armor?

From what we've been able to gather, these men and women are discharged and sent back to their homes if captured by us.

&lt;Nork spits.&gt;

Pathetic...

&lt;The smith frowns and examines the ingots.&gt;

I'll be frank with you, &lt;class&gt;. I'm a relic of an age when cooperation with the Horde was unthinkable.

I am not so blind as to see that we do not have common enemies. I will help you to reforge the anti-demon weapon but it's going to take a lot of hard work and a few 'exotic' resources.

&lt;You tell Harbinger Mikolaas of the survey team's fate. He accepts the crystal from you, but remains silent for a long moment.&gt;

They were good men, &lt;name&gt;, and they knew their mission would be dangerous. I'm grateful for your help in locating the team and recovering the crystal.



We've lost too many good men already, and our mission has only just begun.

&lt;After hearing your retelling of Mevris' plan, Daniss nods thoughtfully.&gt;

I'm glad you were able to assist him. He has been gone for some time now. Hopefully with this creature now deceased, there is one less obstacle before he can come home.

And good work with the scales. These appear to be perfect for the task.

ua:
&lt;Вислухавши твою розповідь про план Мевріса, Данісс задумливо киває.&gt;

Добре, що ти $p(зміг:змогла) йому допомогти. Його немає вже досить давно. Сподіваюся, зі смертю цієї істоти на його шляху додому стало на одну перешкоду менше.

І гарна робота з лускою. Вона, схоже, ідеально підійде для цієї справи.

en:
The Brashtide!?  I thought they were dead and gone YEARS ago!

&lt;Revilgaz listens intently as you relay the information you gathered.&gt;

No, that absolutely makes sense.  And it's not good news either.  The Brashtide are formidable foes, and if their numbers are anywhere near what they were before they disappeared, we're in for a nasty battle.

ua:
Зухвалий Прибій?! Я думав, вони згинули багато РОКІВ тому!

&lt;Ревілгаз уважно слухає, поки ти переказуєш зібрані відомості.&gt;

Ні, це цілком логічно. І це погані новини. Зухвалий Прибій — грізні вороги, і якщо їхня чисельність близька до тієї, що була до їхнього зникнення, на нас чекає жорстока битва.

en:
&lt;The paladin frowns.&gt;

That's quite a gruesome trophy collection you have there. I would have believed you if you had simply said they were dead. Regardless, thank you for having the foresight to take care of them.

The Twilight Gate will soon be ours. Time to move up to the Twilight Citadel.

ua:
&lt;Паладин хмуриться.&gt;

Яка моторошна колекція трофеїв. Я б повірив, якби ти просто сказа$p(в:ла), що вони мертві. Та все одно дякую за передбачливість і за те, що з ними розібралися.

Сутінкова Брама невдовзі буде нашою. Час просуватися до Сутінкової цитаделі.

en:
Collect 6 Glowshrooms.
6Glowshroom (6)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(244429, 0, 6, null, null));

ua:
Збери 6 світлогрибів.
6Світлогриб (6)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(244429, 0, 6, null, null));

&lt;За допомогою своїх інструментів ти обережно граниш самоцвіти й вставляєш їх у порожні гнізда святилища.

З решти матеріалу тобі вдається заповнити тріщини в центральному самоцвіті, вирівнявши його поверхню.

Щойно останній камінь стає на своє місце, зі святилища виходить схожий імпульс енергії, і світло довкола ніби втягується в нього. Дивне сяйво, що йде від святилища, підказує тобі, що воно знову діє.&gt;

en:
Gather frog legs from the Gloombelly Toads at Stillwhisper Pond.
6Juicy Frog Leg (6)



WH.ge('icon-list-icon1').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(244214, 0, 6, null, null));

