WH.ge('icon-list-icon4').appendChild(g_items.createIcon(245886, 0, 1, null, null));

en:
&lt;Aurine accepts the heart.&gt;

Even for a creature of that size, this heart is far too large. It struggled to keep up with the creature's gigantic body. I have little doubt it would've died before reaching half its normal lifespan.

Even with such risks, I'm determined to convince the Consortium to share their technology. There's too much promise here to give up now.

ua:
&lt;Аурін приймає серце.&gt;

Навіть для істоти такого розміру це серце надто велике. Воно ледве встигало за гігантським тілом. Не маю сумніву, що істота померла б, не прожививши й половини свого звичного віку.

Попри такі ризики, я налаштована переконати Консорціум поділитися своєю технологією. Тут надто багато перспектив, щоб тепер здаватися.

en:
&lt;The prince appears emotionally drained.&gt;

This is the end of the road for me, &lt;name&gt;. I can't bear to look at them. Moreover, my mere presence puts you in danger.

Beyond this point, you must walk alone.

ua:
&lt;Принц виглядає геть спустошеним.&gt;

Тут для мене дорога закінчується, {name}. Я не можу на них дивитися. Крім того, сама моя присутність наражає тебе на небезпеку.

Далі тобі доведеться йти самому.

en:
Get a good look around? This place is pretty spooky, even for a savvy gal like me. But get enough Kej together and you'll be able to buy all sorts of stuff, both here and in the City of Threads.

&lt;Linny looks you up and down.&gt;

Then again, you're probably still gonna get eaten, so maybe look into fine nerubian gravestones.

&lt;A gentle, melodic voice fills your mind.&gt;

I am K'ure of the naaru, &lt;name&gt;. You stand within the heart of my ancient vessel. 

Oshu'gun, as the orcs named it, is the ship that first brought the draenei to this world.  Though we fell from the heavens and crashed here many hundreds of years ago, my weakened energies have remained trapped within this wreckage. Regrettably, I am the source of the orc spirits' pain.

NO MERCY FOR THE DEAD!

None of 'em had the guts to stay behind to defend our glorious tanks after Hellscream deemed the coast 'condemned.' It's mostly quiet here, seein' as how the Scourge are formin' up ranks to assault Warsong Hold. Sometimes I get a stray zombie or ghoul, but they don't last very long.

&lt;Gorge strokes his axe.&gt;

'Course, there's the mist...

&lt;Gorge shudders.&gt;

Ah ha! Would you look at dat! I thought I would never see you again!

&lt;Rana snuggles the small stuffed raptor happily.&gt;

What is with dat face? I told the truth.

I lost it when I was a child, so that is practically a lifetime ago, it has tremendous sentimental value to me, and I am one of my people.

But, you did do as I had asked, so I will teach you a little something.

&lt;Rana joyfully explains some of the more elusive techniques to harvesting leather.&gt;

Wow, dis is a nice brooch. Good craftsmanship in it.

Whoever it used to belong to, it is mine now.

&lt;Seeing the disapproval on your face, Secott sighs heavily while rolling his eyes and gives you a sidelong glance.&gt;

Tell ya what, in exchange for dis, I guess I can tell you the rest there is to know about mining monelite seams.

&lt;Secott explains in depth, several techniques which will allow you to mine monelite from seams more effectively.&gt;

I'd've been down there cracking skulls myself, but I'm under strict orders not to engage the enemy.

&lt;The scout grumbles, doing a fair imitation of Blood Guard Gulmok's voice.&gt;

Let's get to work on shutting down production in there.

&lt;Belmont takes the wolfsbane from you.&gt;

Good. Now just do as Forward Commander Onslaught commands. Try your best to fit in with the rest of the soldiers. We don't want the Gilneas Liberation Front to get suspicious.

Oh, you didn't know they were watching us? Right now there are five different worgen spies looking down on our position. Just be calm and follow orders. I'll let you know when we are ready to proceed.
